{
 "cells": [
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "# gl(3), L=1, adjoint: which SoV sums give a rotated lowest-weight covector\n\nQuestion: in the companion frame, which coefficient vectors $c_\\mu$ make $\\sum_\\mu c_\\mu\\langle x_\\mu|=e_8^T\\rho(g)$ for $g\\in GL(3)$?\n\n- $e_8^T$ is the lowest-weight covector, so the raising generators kill it from the right and the Cartan only rescales it. Its orbit is therefore $\\{s\\,e_8^T\\rho(n_-)\\}$ with $n_-=e^{k_{21}E_{21}}e^{k_{31}E_{31}}e^{k_{32}E_{32}}$: a 4-dimensional cone (the minimal nilpotent orbit of sl(3)).\n- Setup cells are copied verbatim from `Companion-B-C-diagonalize-clean.wb` (rep, companion $t$'s, SoV bases $\\langle x_\\mu|$, $|y_\\mu\\rangle$).",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* fresh kernel state so the notebook is self-contained *)\nClearAll[\"Global`*\"];\n(* GT basis and gl(3) generators, verbatim from Companion-B-C-diagonalize-clean.wb *)\nps[rep_] := ps[rep] = Block[{res = (Prepend[rep, #1] &) /@ Tuples[Table[Range[rep[[1, i + 1]], rep[[1, i]]], {i, 1, Length[rep[[1]]] - 1}]]}, If[Length[res[[1, 1]]] == 1, Reverse[Sort[res]], Reverse[Sort[Flatten[ps /@ res, 1]]]]];\ndim[rep_] := dim[rep] = Length[ps[{rep}]];\nJ0[k_][pat_] := J0[k][pat] = Sum[pat[[k, i]], {i, 1, k}] - Sum[pat[[k - 1, i]], {i, 1, k - 1}];\nJp[k_][pat_] := Jp[k][pat] = -Sum[(Product[pat[[k, i]] - i - pat[[k + 1, j]] + j, {j, Range[k + 1]}]/Product[pat[[k, i]] - i - pat[[k, j]] + j, {j, Complement[Range[k], {i}]}])*v[ReplacePart[pat, {k, i} -> pat[[k, i]] + 1]], {i, 1, k}];\nJm[k_][pat_] := Jm[k][pat] = Sum[(Product[pat[[k, i]] - i - pat[[k - 1, j]] + j, {j, Range[k - 1]}]/Product[pat[[k, i]] - i - pat[[k, j]] + j, {j, Complement[Range[k], {i}]}])*v[ReplacePart[pat, {k, i} -> pat[[k, i]] - 1]], {i, 1, k}];\nJJ[k_, l_, rep_] := JJ[k, l, rep] = Which[\n  k == l, DiagonalMatrix[J0[k] /@ ps[{rep}]],\n  l == k + 1, Transpose[Table[(Coefficient[Jp[k][ps[{rep}][[i]]], v[#1]] &) /@ ps[{rep}], {i, 1, Length[ps[{rep}]]}]],\n  l == k - 1, Transpose[Table[(Coefficient[Jm[l][ps[{rep}][[i]]], v[#1]] &) /@ ps[{rep}], {i, 1, Length[ps[{rep}]]}]],\n  l > k + 1, JJ[k, k + 1, rep] . JJ[k + 1, l, rep] - JJ[k + 1, l, rep] . JJ[k, k + 1, rep],\n  l < k - 1, JJ[k, k - 1, rep] . JJ[k - 1, l, rep] - JJ[k - 1, l, rep] . JJ[k, k - 1, rep]];\nchecks = <||>;",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<details class=\"vscode-wolfram-message-output\" style=\"color:#f44;border-left:3px solid #f44;background:rgba(255,68,68,0.08);padding:2px 6px;margin:1px 0;border-radius:0 3px 3px 0;font-family:monospace;font-size:0.85em\"><summary style=\"cursor:pointer\">4 warnings</summary><div style=\"padding:2px 0 2px 4px;border-top:1px solid rgba(255,68,68,0.15)\">ClearAll::wrsym: Symbol ClearGlobals is Protected.</div><div style=\"padding:2px 0 2px 4px;border-top:1px solid rgba(255,68,68,0.15)\">ClearAll::wrsym: Symbol VsCodeCleanupImgDir is Protected.</div><div style=\"padding:2px 0 2px 4px;border-top:1px solid rgba(255,68,68,0.15)\">ClearAll::wrsym: Symbol VsCodeDynExportValue is Protected.</div><div style=\"padding:2px 0 2px 4px;border-top:1px solid rgba(255,68,68,0.15)\">General::stop: Further output of ClearAll::wrsym will be suppressed during this calculation.</div></details>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "ClearAll::wrsym: Symbol ClearGlobals is Protected.\nClearAll::wrsym: Symbol VsCodeCleanupImgDir is Protected.\nClearAll::wrsym: Symbol VsCodeDynExportValue is Protected.\nGeneral::stop: Further output of ClearAll::wrsym will be suppressed during this calculation.",
       "mime": "text/plain"
