   "value": "## 2. Covectors as traceless 3×3 matrices\nThe equivariant map $\\varphi\\mapsto X(\\varphi)$ satisfies $X(\\varphi\\,(E_{ab}-\\delta_{ab}))=[X(\\varphi),e_{ab}]$. It is solved for linearly and is unique up to scale; the scale is fixed by $X(e_8^T)=e_{13}$. The basis covectors map to:\n\n| $\\mu$ | $X(\\langle x_\\mu|)$ |\n|---|---|\n| {2\\|21} | $3e_{31}$ |\n| {2\\|11} | $3h(e_{32}-e_{21})$ |\n| {1\\|11} | $3h^2(2e_{33}-e_{11}-e_{22})$ |\n| {2\\|20} | $-3h\\,e_{21}$ |\n| {2\\|10} | $3h^2(e_{11}-e_{22})$ |\n| {2\\|00} | $3h^3(2e_{12}+e_{23})$ |\n| {1\\|10} | $-9h^3e_{23}$ |\n| {1\\|00} | $9h^4e_{13}$ |\n\nThe rotated covector maps to $X(e_8^T\\rho(n_-))=a\\,b^T$, with $a=(1,-k_{21},k_{21}k_{32}-k_{31})$ (first column of $n_-^{-1}$), $b=(k_{31},k_{32},1)$ (last row of $n_-$) and $b\\cdot a=0$.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "X3[φ_] := Table[Sum[φ[[r]] A[r, i, j], {r, 8}], {i, 3}, {j, 3}];\nφg = Array[ff, 8];\ne3[a_, b_] := Table[KroneckerDelta[a, i] KroneckerDelta[b, j], {i, 3}, {j, 3}];\n(* trace removed: rho = adj x det here *)\neqsInt = Flatten[Table[CoefficientList[Flatten[X3[φg . (Ee[a, b] - KroneckerDelta[a, b] IdentityMatrix[8])] - (X3[φg] . e3[a, b] - e3[a, b] . X3[φg])], φg], {a, 3}, {b, 3}]];\nsolInt = Solve[Thread[eqsInt == 0], Flatten[Array[A, {8, 3, 3}]]];\nchecks[\"intertwiner unique up to scale\"] = Length[Variables[Flatten[Array[A, {8, 3, 3}] /. solInt[[1]]]]] == 1;\nAint = Array[A, {8, 3, 3}] /. solInt[[1]] /. A[5, 3, 3] -> 1;\nXof[φ_] := Simplify[Sum[φ[[r]] Aint[[r]], {r, 8}]];\nXofX = Table[Xof[Xmat[[m]]], {m, 8}];\nchecks[\"X(e8^T) = e13\"] = Xof[UnitVector[8, 8]] === e3[1, 3];\naV = {1, -k21, k21 k32 - k31}; bV = {k31, k32, 1};\nchecks[\"X(e8^T rho(n_-)) = a b^T, b.a = 0\"] = Simplify[Xof[rot] - Outer[Times, aV, bV]] === ConstantArray[0, {3, 3}] && Simplify[bV . aV] === 0;\nGrid[Prepend[Transpose[{gtpats, MatrixForm /@ XofX}], {\"μ\", \"X(<x_μ|)\"}], Frame -> All]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
