t\" style=\"height:17.2501em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-31.3002em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:17.2501em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-32.5002em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:17.2501em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:14.7501em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "Out[1298]= \\begin{array}{|c|c|}\\hline\\mu  & \\text{X(<x\\_$\\mu$|)}\\\\\\hline\\left\\{\\left\\{2\\right\\},\\left\\{2,1\\right\\}\\right\\} & \\begin{pmatrix}0 & 0 & 0\\\\0 & 0 & 0\\\\3 & 0 & 0\\end{pmatrix}\\\\\\hline\\left\\{\\left\\{2\\right\\},\\left\\{1,1\\right\\}\\right\\} & \\begin{pmatrix}0 & 0 & 0\\\\-3\\,h & 0 & 0\\\\0 & 3\\,h & 0\\end{pmatrix}\\\\\\hline\\left\\{\\left\\{1\\right\\},\\left\\{1,1\\right\\}\\right\\} & \\begin{pmatrix}-3\\,h^2 & 0 & 0\\\\0 & -3\\,h^2 & 0\\\\0 & 0 & 6\\,h^2\\end{pmatrix}\\\\\\hline\\left\\{\\left\\{2\\right\\},\\left\\{2,0\\right\\}\\right\\} & \\begin{pmatrix}0 & 0 & 0\\\\-3\\,h & 0 & 0\\\\0 & 0 & 0\\end{pmatrix}\\\\\\hline\\left\\{\\left\\{2\\right\\},\\left\\{1,0\\right\\}\\right\\} & \\begin{pmatrix}3\\,h^2 & 0 & 0\\\\0 & -3\\,h^2 & 0\\\\0 & 0 & 0\\end{pmatrix}\\\\\\hline\\left\\{\\left\\{2\\right\\},\\left\\{0,0\\right\\}\\right\\} & \\begin{pmatrix}0 & 6\\,h^3 & 0\\\\0 & 0 & 3\\,h^3\\\\0 & 0 & 0\\end{pmatrix}\\\\\\hline\\left\\{\\left\\{1\\right\\},\\left\\{1,0\\right\\}\\right\\} & \\begin{pmatrix}0 & 0 & 0\\\\0 & 0 & -9\\,h^3\\\\0 & 0 & 0\\end{pmatrix}\\\\\\hline\\left\\{\\left\\{1\\right\\},\\left\\{0,0\\right\\}\\right\\} & \\begin{pmatrix}0 & 0 & 9\\,h^4\\\\0 & 0 & 0\\\\0 & 0 & 0\\end{pmatrix}\\\\\\hline\\end{array}",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
     ],
     "id": "d247b5a1-a6d6-464f-a08e-4607a7a58135"
