    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<span style=\"display:none\"></span>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "Solve::svars: Equations may not give solutions for all \"solve\" variables.",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      },
      {
       "data": "{\n\t\"name\": \"WolframKernelMessage\",\n\t\"message\": \"Solve::svars: Equations may not give solutions for all \\\"solve\\\" variables.\",\n\t\"stack\": \"\"\n}",
       "mime": "application/vnd.code.notebook.error"
      }
     ],
     "id": "9b1ad6fe-bd17-4e6d-8886-676fb39471f3"
    }
   ],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## 3. Classification\nInverting the table of Section 2, $\\sum_\\mu c_\\mu\\langle x_\\mu|$ corresponds to the traceless matrix $X$ with\n$$c_{\\{2|21\\}}=\\tfrac{X_{31}}3,\\ c_{\\{2|11\\}}=\\tfrac{X_{32}}{3h},\\ c_{\\{1|11\\}}=\\tfrac{X_{33}}{6h^2},\\ c_{\\{2|20\\}}=-\\tfrac{X_{21}+X_{32}}{3h},\\ c_{\\{2|10\\}}=\\tfrac{X_{11}-X_{22}}{6h^2},\\ c_{\\{2|00\\}}=\\tfrac{X_{12}}{6h^3},\\ c_{\\{1|10\\}}=\\tfrac{X_{12}-2X_{23}}{18h^3},\\ c_{\\{1|00\\}}=\\tfrac{X_{13}}{9h^4}.$$\nThe orbit of $e_8^T$ is the minimal nilpotent orbit, $\\{X\\neq0:\\ \\mathrm{rank}\\,X=1,\\ \\mathrm{tr}\\,X=0\\}=\\{a\\,b^T:\\ a,b\\neq0,\\ b\\cdot a=0\\}$.\n\nSo **$\\sum_\\mu c_\\mu\\langle x_\\mu|=s\\,e_8^T\\rho(g)$ for some $g\\in GL(3)$ and $s\\ne0$ if and only if $c=c(a,b)$**, where\n$$c(a,b)=\\Big(\\tfrac{a_3b_1}{3},\\ \\tfrac{a_3b_2}{3h},\\ \\tfrac{a_3b_3}{6h^2},\\ -\\tfrac{a_2b_1+a_3b_2}{3h},\\ \\tfrac{a_1b_1-a_2b_2}{6h^2},\\ \\tfrac{a_1b_2}{6h^3},\\ \\tfrac{a_1b_2-2a_2b_3}{18h^3},\\ \\tfrac{a_1b_3}{9h^4}\\Big),\\qquad b\\cdot a=0.$$\nEquivalently, all $2\\times2$ minors of $X(c)$ vanish. The orbit has dimension 6 − 1 − 1 = 4: six components of $a,b$, minus the rescaling $(a,b)\\to(ta,b/t)$, minus the constraint $b\\cdot a=0$.\n\nFor $g=n_+\\,d\\,n_-$, $a\\propto n_-^{-1}e_1$ and $b\\propto e_3^Tn_-$. Here $n_+$ drops out and $d$ only rescales.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "cAB[a_, b_] := {a[[3]] b[[1]]/3, a[[3]] b[[2]]/(3 h), a[[3]] b[[3]]/(6 h^2), -(a[[2]] b[[1]] + a[[3]] b[[2]])/(3 h), (a[[1]] b[[1]] - a[[2]] b[[2]])/(6 h^2), a[[1]] b[[2]]/(6 h^3), (a[[1]] b[[2]] - 2 a[[2]] b[[3]])/(18 h^3), a[[1]] b[[3]]/(9 h^4)};\n(* impose b.a = 0 by solving for a1 *)\naS = {-(α[2] β[2] + α[3] β[3])/β[1], α[2], α[3]}; bS = Array[β, 3];\nchecks[\"X(sum c(a,b) <x|) = a b^T when b.a = 0\"] = Simplify[Xof[cAB[aS, bS] . Xmat] - Outer[Times, aS, bS]] === ConstantArray[0, {3, 3}];\nchecks[\"c(a,b) reproduces c_mu(n_-)\"] = Simplify[cAB[aV, bV] - cX] === ConstantArray[0, 8];\n(* full GL(3): random 9-parameter g, adjoint matrix as exp of generators; numeric at 50 digits *)\nω = {{1/3, -2/5, 3/7}, {5/11, -1/4, 2/9}, {-3/8, 4/13, 1/6}};\nρN = MatrixExp[N[Sum[ω[[i, j]] Ee[i, j], {i, 3}, {j, 3}], 50]];\ngN = MatrixExp[N[ω, 50]];\nφN = UnitVector[8, 8] . ρN;\nXN = Xof[φN] /. h -> 1;\npredXN = Inverse[gN] . e3[1, 3] . gN;\nratio = XN[[1, 3]]/predXN[[1, 3]];\nchecks[\"full GL(3): X(e8^T rho(g)) ∝ g^-1 e13 g\"] = Max[Abs[Flatten[XN - ratio predXN]]];\naN = Inverse[gN][[All, 1]]; bN = gN[[3]];\nchecks[\"full GL(3): c = s c(a,b) with a = g^-1 e1, b = e3^T g\"] = Max[Abs[(φN . Inverse[Xmat /. h -> 1]) - ratio (cAB[aN, bN] /. h -> 1)]];\nchecks[\"full GL(3): rank X = 1 (2nd singular value)\"] = SingularValueList[XN, 2][[2]];\nGrid[KeyValueMap[{#1, #2} &, checks], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
