       "data": "Out[1335]= \\begin{aligned}\n  &\\left\\{\\mathrm{True},\\begin{pmatrix}2 & 1 & 0\\\\1 & 2 & 0\\\\1 & 1 & 1\\\\0 & 2 & 1\\\\0 & 1 & 2\\\\1 & 1 & 1\\\\2 & 0 & 1\\\\1 & 0 & 2\\end{pmatrix} \\right. \\\\\n  &\\left. ,\\begin{pmatrix}2 & 1 & 0\\\\1 & 2 & 0\\\\0 & 2 & 1\\\\1 & 1 & 1\\\\2 & 0 & 1\\\\0 & 1 & 2\\\\1 & 0 & 2\\\\1 & 1 & 1\\end{pmatrix}\\right\\}\n\\end{aligned}",
