  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* det N with the ket's dual Q's and an arbitrary bra-side F; Fv[i, m] = F_i(θ + m h) *)\ndetNF[K_, B_, Fv_] := Det[Table[Sum[With[{xx = thN - n hN}, wgt[n] {-QU[K, B, j, xx] Fv[i, -n], QU[K, B, j, xx] Fv[i, -n + 1], QU[K, B, j, xx - hN] Fv[i, -n]}], {n, polesN}], {ij, {{1, 3}, {1, 2}, {2, 3}}}, {i, {ij[[1]]}}, {j, {ij[[2]]}}][[All, 1, 1]]];\nketInvT = Inverse[Transpose[ketZ]];\n(* covector defined by det N on the eigenkets *)\nφF[Fv_] := Table[detNF[SZ, B, Fv]/psiQ[SZ, B], {B, nS}] . ketInvT;\nfsym = Flatten[Table[f[i, m], {i, 3}, {m, -2, 1}]];\nφFsym = Chop[Expand[φF[f]], 10^-40];\n(* known case: F = direct Q's of bra A of twist w gives braW[[A]], up to scale *)\nFofW[A_] := Function[{i, m}, QD[SW, A, i, thN + m hN]];\nchecks[\"det N[Q_z, Q_w,A] gives the w eigen-bra A (all 8)\"] = Max[Table[With[{v = φF[FofW[A]]}, Norm[v/(v . y0N) - braW[[A]]]], {A, nS}]];\n(* rank of X for each w eigen-bra: 2nd singular value *)\nrankW = Table[{SW[\"mu\"][[A]], SingularValueList[Xof[braW[[A]]] /. h -> hN, 3]}, {A, nS}];\n{checks[\"det N[Q_z, Q_w,A] gives the w eigen-bra A (all 8)\"], Grid[rankW, Frame -> All]}",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
