 style=\"top:-9.166em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.016em;\"></span><span class=\"delimsizinginner delim-size4\"><span>⎫</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:4.55em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:5.47em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div></div>",
