  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### 4a. The image of $F\\mapsto\\varphi_F$\n- **Which data enter.** The rows of $\\det N$ are $(i,j)=(1,3),(1,2),(2,3)$, so only $F_1,F_2$ enter: $F_1$ in two rows and $F_2$ in one.\n- **Invariance.** $\\varphi_F$ is unchanged under $F_2\\to F_2+cF_1$, because that adds a multiple of row 1 to row 3.\n- **Dimension.** So $\\varphi_F$ depends only on the flag $[F_1]\\subset\\mathrm{span}(F_1,F_2)\\subset\\mathbb C^4$, where $\\mathbb C^4$ holds the values at $\\theta-2h,\\dots,\\theta+h$, plus an overall scale: $3+2+1=6$.\n- **Numerics.** The Jacobian rank of $F\\mapsto\\varphi_F$ is 6, and the image is not a linear subspace. Exactly 3 quadrics vanish on it.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "SeedRandom[7];\njac = D[φFsym, {fsym}] /. Thread[fsym -> RandomReal[{-1, 1}, 12, WorkingPrecision -> 60]];\nchecks[\"rank of F -> φ_F (6)\"] = MatrixRank[jac, Tolerance -> 10^-40];\nSeedRandom[3];\nsampI = Table[φFsym /. Thread[fsym -> RandomReal[{-1, 1}, 12, WorkingPrecision -> 60]], {80}];\nchecks[\"image spans all 8 dims (not linear)\"] = MatrixRank[sampI, Tolerance -> 10^-40];\nph = Array[pp, 8];\nmons2 = DeleteDuplicates[Flatten[Outer[Times, ph, ph]]];\nquadNS = NullSpace[Table[mons2 /. Thread[ph -> s/Norm[s]], {s, sampI}], Tolerance -> 10^-35];\nchecks[\"# quadrics vanishing on image (3)\"] = Length[quadNS];\nquads[φ_] := Table[q . (mons2 /. Thread[ph -> φ/Norm[φ]]), {q, quadNS}];\nKeyTake[checks, {\"rank of F -> φ_F (6)\", \"image spans all 8 dims (not linear)\", \"# quadrics vanishing on image (3)\"}]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"485294\" data-output-id=\"96\" data-out-n=\"1356\" data-sub-idx=\"11\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"14\" data-sub-start=\"11\" data-sub-end=\"11\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[1356]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"21\" data-line-broken=\"1\" data-latex-b64=\"XGJlZ2lue2FsaWduZWR9CiAgJlxsYW5nbGVcIVxsdmVydCBcdGV4dHtyYW5rIG9mIEYgLT4gJFx2YXJwaGkkXF9GICg2KX1cdG8gNiBcXAogICYsXHRleHR7aW1hZ2Ugc3BhbnMgYWxsIDggZGltcyAobm90IGxpbmVhcil9XHRvIDggXFwKICAmLFx0ZXh0e1wjIHF1YWRyaWNzIHZhbmlzaGluZyBvbiBpbWFnZSAoMyl9XHRvIDNccnZlcnRcIVxyYW5nbGUKXGVuZHthbGlnbmVkfQ==\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:4.5em;vertical-align:-2em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"col-align-r\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"><span style=\"top:-4.5em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.84em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.84em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.5em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.84em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"col-align-l\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"><span style=\"top:-4.66em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">⟨</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">∣</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">rank of F -&gt; </span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">φ</span><span class=\"mord\">_F (6)</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">6</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.16em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">image spans all 8 dims (not linear)</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">8</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.66em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"># quadrics vanishing on image (3)</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mclose\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mclose\">⟩</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "Out[1356]= \\begin{aligned}\n  &\\langle\\!\\lvert \\text{rank of F -> $\\varphi$\\_F (6)}\\to 6 \\\\\n  &,\\text{image spans all 8 dims (not linear)}\\to 8 \\\\\n  &,\\text{\\# quadrics vanishing on image (3)}\\to 3\\rvert\\!\\rangle\n\\end{aligned}",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
     ],
     "id": "232525ee-ec4e-48e4-8b89-7f6f8c3cea55"
    }
   ],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### 4b. Orbit ∩ image: two components\nWrite $\\varphi_{ab}=\\sum_\\mu c_\\mu(a,b)\\langle x_\\mu|$ with $b\\cdot a=0$, and $m(x)=(x^2,x,1)$. Restricted to the orbit, the 3 quadrics vanish exactly on two components:\n- **(I)** $b\\propto m(\\beta)$ (moment curve, $b_1b_3=b_2^2$), with $a\\perp b$ otherwise free. This piece does not depend on $z$.\n- **(II)** $a\\perp m(z_3)$, with $b\\perp a$ otherwise free. This piece depends on the ket twist $z$.\n  - Here $z_3=2/3=1/z_1$, so the vector also equals $(1,z_1,z_1^2)$ up to scale. The code below uses that form (`z1Orb`).\n  - Section 6b shows, with a second twist, that $m(z_3)$ is the correct reading.\n\n**Evidence.**\n- The quadrics vanish identically on (I).\n- For random $b$ there is exactly one extra $a$, and it satisfies $a\\cdot m(z_3)=0$.\n- For random $a$, the only solutions are on (I).\n\n**Constructive check.** The quadrics alone could cut out more than the image, so membership is checked directly. $\\varphi_F=\\varphi_{ab}$ is solved for $F$ by FindRoot from random starts. It succeeds on (I), (II) and the $w$-bras, and fails on generic orbit points.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "φAB[a_, b_] := N[cAB[a, b] . Xmat /. h -> hN, prec];\nrandOrb := Module[{b = RandomReal[{-1, 1}, 3, WorkingPrecision -> 60]}, φAB[Cross[b, RandomReal[{-1, 1}, 3, WorkingPrecision -> 60]], b]];\nmomOrb := Module[{β = RandomReal[{-2, 2}, WorkingPrecision -> 60], b}, b = {β^2, β, 1}; φAB[Cross[b, RandomReal[{-1, 1}, 3, WorkingPrecision -> 60]], b]];\nz1Orb := Module[{b = RandomReal[{-1, 1}, 3, WorkingPrecision -> 60]}, φAB[Cross[b, {1, z[1], z[1]^2} /. pt], b]];\nSeedRandom[5];\nchecks[\"quadrics on generic orbit points (nonzero)\"] = Min[Table[Max[Abs[quads[randOrb]]], {10}]];\nchecks[\"quadrics on (I): b on moment curve\"] = Max[Table[Max[Abs[quads[momOrb]]], {10}]];\nchecks[\"quadrics on (II): a ⟂ (1,z1,z1^2)\"] = Max[Table[Max[Abs[quads[z1Orb]]], {10}]];\n(* for random a (b ⟂ a), all roots of quadric 1 lie on the moment curve and kill quadrics 2,3 *)\nSeedRandom[55];\nchecks[\"random a: all solutions on (I)\"] = Max[Flatten[Table[Module[{av = RandomReal[{-1, 1}, 3, WorkingPrecision -> 60], ns, bt, qs, sols},\n    ns = NullSpace[{av}]; bt = ns[[1]] + S1 ns[[2]];\n    qs = Expand[Table[q . (mons2 /. Thread[ph -> φAB[av, bt]]), {q, quadNS}]];\n    sols = NSolve[qs[[1]] == 0, S1, WorkingPrecision -> 40];\n    Table[Abs[(bt[[1]] bt[[3]] - bt[[2]]^2)/Norm[bt]^2 /. s], {s, sols}]], {4}]]];\nKeyTake[checks, {\"quadrics on generic orbit points (nonzero)\", \"quadrics on (I): b on moment curve\", \"quadrics on (II): a ⟂ (1,z1,z1^2)\", \"random a: all solutions on (I)\"}]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"485294\" data-output-id=\"97\" data-out-n=\"1367\" data-sub-idx=\"11\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"16\" data-sub-start=\"15\" data-sub-end=\"15\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[1367]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"21\" data-line-broken=\"1\" data-latex-b64=\"\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:10.5723em;vertical-align:-5.0362em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"col-align-r\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:5.5362em;\"><span style=\"top:-7.5603em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.8641em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-6.0603em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.8641em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.5603em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.8641em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.0362em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.8641em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.5362em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.8641em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-0.0121em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.8641em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:1.5121em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.8641em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:5.0362em;\"><span></span></span></span></spa