  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### 4d. Any rotation is a sum of two determinants from one companion twist\n- **The split.** Let $\\beta_{1,2}$ be the roots of $a_1x^2+a_2x+a_3=0$. Both $m(\\beta_k)=(\\beta_k^2,\\beta_k,1)$ are $\\perp a$, so they span $a^\\perp\\ni b$, and $ab^T=s_1\\,a\\,m(\\beta_1)^T+s_2\\,a\\,m(\\beta_2)^T$.\n- **Both terms are eigen-bras of the same twist.** Each term is in component (I), and both are eigen-bras of $t(G(\\alpha,\\beta_1,\\beta_2))$ for any $\\alpha$. Their weights are $e_\\alpha-e_{\\beta_1}$ and $e_\\alpha-e_{\\beta_2}$.\n- **Consequence.** $e_8^T\\rho(g)\\cdot\\Psi$ is a sum of two $\\det N[Q_\\Psi,Q_{A_k,w}]$ with $w=(\\alpha,\\beta_1,\\beta_2)$. Here $a=g^{-1}e_1$ fixes the twist, and $b=e_3^Tg$ fixes $s_{1,2}$.\n- **The other split fails.** Splitting $a$ instead would need $b$ on the moment curve.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* generic full GL(3) element *)\nωg = {{-1/5, 2/7, -1/3}, {3/4, 1/6, -2/9}, {1/8, -3/5, 2/11}};\ngG = MatrixExp[N[ωg, prec]]; aG = Inverse[gG][[All, 1]]; bG = gG[[3]];\nφG = N[UnitVector[8, 8] . MatrixExp[N[Sum[ωg[[i, j]] Ee[i, j], {i, 3}, {j, 3}], prec]], prec];\nchecks[\"4d: φ(g) = φ_ab(a=g^-1 e1, b=e3^T g) up to scale\"] = With[{v = φAB[aG, bG]}, Norm[φG/(φG . y0N) - v/(v . y0N)]];\nβs = x /. NSolve[aG . {x^2, x, 1} == 0, x, WorkingPrecision -> 50];\nchecks[\"4d: off moment curve (single det impossible)\"] = Abs[bG[[1]] bG[[3]] - bG[[2]]^2]/Norm[bG]^2;\n(* the two eigen-bras of t(G(α, β1, β2)) with X ∝ a m(βk)^T, then a 2-term least-squares fit of φ(g) *)\nprojRes[u_, v_] := Norm[u - (Conjugate[v] . u/(Conjugate[v] . v)) v]/Norm[u];\ntwoTerm[α_] := Module[{S = stateData[{α, βs[[1]], βs[[2]]}], brs, pick, coef},\n   brs = Table[wv/(wv . y0N), {wv, S[\"vecL\"]}];\n   pick = Table[First[Ordering[Table[projRes[Flatten[Xof[brs[[A]]] /. h -> hN], Flatten[Outer[Times, aG, {βk^2, βk, 1}]]], {A, nS}], 1]], {βk, βs}];\n   coef = LeastSquares[Transpose[brs[[pick]]], φG];\n   {S[\"mu\"][[pick]], Max[Table[projRes[Flatten[Xof[brs[[pick[[k]]]]] /. h -> hN], Flatten[Outer[Times, aG, {βs[[k]]^2, βs[[k]], 1}]]], {k, 2}]], Norm[Transpose[brs[[pick]]] . coef - φG]/Norm[φG]}];\ntt4d = Table[twoTerm[α], {α, {13/10, -3/2}}];\nchecks[\"4d: picked bras have X ∝ a m(βk)^T\"] = Max[tt4d[[All, 2]]];\nchecks[\"4d: φ(g) = s1 bra1 + s2 bra2 of one companion twist (any α)\"] = Max[tt4d[[All, 3]]];\n{N[βs, 6], tt4d[[All, 1]], KeyTake[checks, {\"4d: φ(g) = φ_ab(a=g^-1 e1, b=e3^T g) up to scale\", \"4d: off moment curve (single det impossible)\", \"4d: picked bras have X ∝ a m(βk)^T\", \"4d: φ(g) = s1 bra1 + s2 bra2 of one companion twist (any α)\"}]}",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
