      {
       "data": "Out[1428]= \\begin{aligned}\n  &\\left\\{\\left\\{-0.294872,0.924565\\right\\} \\right. \\\\\n  &\\left. ,\\begin{pmatrix}\\left\\{0,2,1\\right\\} & \\left\\{0,1,2\\right\\}\\\\\\left\\{0,2,1\\right\\} & \\left\\{0,1,2\\right\\}\\end{pmatrix},\\langle\\! \\right. \\\\\n  &\\left. \\lvert \\text{4d: $\\varphi$(g) = $\\varphi$\\_ab(a=g\\^{}-1 e1, b=e3\\^{}T g) up to scale}\\to 0,\\text{4d: off moment curve (single det impossible)}\\to 0.310034044494668790187884553042 \\right.{\\color{gray}\\vdots} \\\\\n  &\\left. {\\color{gray}\\vdots}59336260286548527960752866015,\\text{4d: picked bras have X $\\propto$ a m($\\beta$k)\\^{}T} \\right. \\\\\n  &\\left. \\to 0,\\text{4d: $\\varphi$(g) = s1 bra1 + s2 bra2 of one companion twist (any $\\alpha$)} \\right. \\\\\n  &\\left. \\to 0\\rvert\\!\\rangle \\right\\}\n\\end{aligned}",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
     ],
     "id": "631de4c9-f0b4-4893-88ba-216df8ced015"
    }
   ],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## 6. Ways to get more than companion eigen-bras\n### 6a. Symmetries of the SoV basis\nIf $\\rho(Y)$ had every $\\langle x_\\mu|$ as an eigen-covector, rotating by $e^{Y}$ would only rescale the SoV coefficients. It would then map single determinants to new single determinants. Two linear conditions on $Y=\\sum y_{ab}E_{ab}$ are solved:\n- $\\langle x_\\mu|\\rho(Y)\\wedge\\langle x_\\mu|=0$ for all $\\mu$;\n- $[\\rho(Y),B(u)]=\\kappa B(u)$ for all $u$, i.e. $B$ is rescaled.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "Yg = Sum[y[a, b] Ee[a, b], {a, 3}, {b, 3}]; yv = Flatten[Array[y, {3, 3}]];\n(* every <x_mu| an eigen-covector of rho(Y): all 2x2 minors of {x_mu.Y, x_mu} vanish (linear in y since x_mu fixed) *)\neigEqs = Flatten[Table[Minors[{Xmat[[m]] . Yg, Xmat[[m]]}, 2], {m, 8}]];\nstabX = NullSpace[Table[Coefficient[e, yv[[k]]], {e, Select[Expand[eigEqs], # =!= 0 &]}, {k, 9}]];\n(* [rho(Y), B(u)] = kappa B(u) for all u *)\nbEqs = Flatten[CoefficientList[Expand[Yg . Bop[u] - Bop[u] . Yg - κ Bop[u]], u]];\nstabB = Solve[Thread[bEqs == 0], Append[yv, κ]];\nchecks[\"6a: dim of Y keeping all <x_mu| eigen\"] = Length[stabX];\n{Simplify[stabX], Simplify[Array[y, {3, 3}] /. stabB], κ /. stabB}",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"vscode-wolfram-message-output\" style=\"color:#f44;border-left:3px solid #f44;background:rgba(255,68,68,0.08);padding:2px 6px;margin:1px 0;border-radius:0 3px 3px 0;font-family:monospace;font-size:0.85em;white-space:pre-wrap\">Solve::svars: Equations may not give solutions for all &quot;solve&quot; variables.</div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
