      {
       "data": "Solve::svars: Equations may not give solutions for all \"solve\" variables.",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      },
      {
       "data": "{\n\t\"name\": \"WolframKernelMessage\",\n\t\"message\": \"Solve::svars: Equations may not give solutions for all \\\"solve\\\" variables.\",\n\t\"stack\": \"\"\n}",
       "mime": "application/vnd.code.notebook.error"
      }
     ],
     "id": "03aead03-d04b-4ec6-b6fe-e36096386ced"
    }
   ],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "**Result 6a.** The symmetries form $Y=\\mathrm{diag}(y_1,y_2,2y_2-y_1)$: the identity plus $H=\\mathrm{diag}(1,0,-1)$. They are the same for both conditions, with $\\kappa=0$. The torus $d=\\mathrm{diag}(t,1,1/t)$ maps $m(\\beta)\\to m(t\\beta)$, so it only rescales the twist ($G(tw)=DG(w)D^{-1}$) and preserves component (I). **Nothing new.**\n\n### 6b. Other choices of the three rows of $\\det N$\nThere are 84 choices of 3 of the 9 pairs $(i,j)$. For each one, the first test is whether $\\det N^R[Q_B,Q_{w,A}]/\\Psi^B_Q(x_0)$ still gives the $w$ eigen-bras. Then the image of $F\\mapsto\\varphi^R_F$ (dimension, and whether it meets the orbit beyond (I)) is examined for the working choices.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "allPairs = Tuples[Range[3], 2]; rowChoices = Subsets[allPairs, {3}];\ndetNR[R_, K_, B_, Fv_] := Det[Table[Sum[With[{xx = thN - n hN}, wgt[n] {-QU[K, B, j, xx] Fv[i, -n], QU[K, B, j, xx] Fv[i, -n + 1], QU[K, B, j, xx - hN] Fv[i, -n]}], {n, polesN}], {ij, R}, {i, {ij[[1]]}}, {j, {ij[[2]]}}][[All, 1, 1]]];\nFofW[A_] := Function[{i, m}, QD[SW, A, i, thN + m hN]];\n(* R reproduces the twisted overlaps iff M_AB = detN^R[Q_B, Q_{w,A}]/<Psi_A,w|Psi_B,z> = kappa_B lambda_A (rank 1); kappa_B = M[[1,B]] is R's ket factor *)\ngramWZ = Table[braW[[A]] . ketZ[[B]], {A, nS}, {B, nS}];\nrowInfo = Table[Module[{M = Table[detNR[R, SZ, B, FofW[A]], {A, nS}, {B, nS}]/gramWZ, sv},\n    sv = SingularValueList[M, 2, Tolerance -> 0]; {R, If[sv[[1]] < 10^-30, Infinity, sv[[2]]/sv[[1]]], M[[1]]}], {R, rowChoices}];\ngoodR2 = Select[rowInfo, #[[2]] < 10^-30 &];\nchecks[\"6b: # row choices reproducing twisted overlaps (72)\"] = Length[goodR2];\n(* image dimension of F -> phi^R_F *)\nSeedRandom[8];\nfrand = Thread[fsym -> RandomReal[{-1, 1}, 12, WorkingPrecision -> 60]];\nimgInfo = Table[Module[{R = ri[[1]], kap = ri[[3]], φs},\n    φs = Table[detNR[R, SZ, B, f]/kap[[B]], {B, nS}] . ketInvT;\n    {R, Length[Union[R[[All, 1]]]], MatrixRank[D[φs, {fsym}] /. frand, Tolerance -> 10^-35]}], {ri, goodR2}];\nr18 = Select[imgInfo, #[[3]] == 7 &][[All, 1]];\n{Length[goodR2], Select[rowInfo, #[[2]] >= 10^-30 &][[All, 1]], Tally[imgInfo[[All, 2 ;; 3]]]}",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
