\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.45em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.61em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">54</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.41em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">18</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.95em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">)</span></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">}</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:8.4501em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "Out[1477]= \\begin{aligned}\n  &\\left\\{72,\\begin{pmatrix}\\left\\{1,1\\right\\} & \\left\\{1,2\\right\\} & \\left\\{1,3\\right\\}\\\\\\left\\{1,1\\right\\} & \\left\\{2,1\\right\\} & \\left\\{3,1\\right\\}\\\\\\left\\{1,1\\right\\} & \\left\\{2,2\\right\\} & \\left\\{3,3\\right\\}\\\\\\left\\{1,1\\right\\} & \\left\\{2,3\\right\\} & \\left\\{3,2\\right\\}\\\\\\left\\{1,2\\right\\} & \\left\\{2,1\\right\\} & \\left\\{3,3\\right\\}\\\\\\left\\{1,2\\right\\} & \\left\\{2,2\\right\\} & \\left\\{3,2\\right\\}\\\\\\left\\{1,2\\right\\} & \\left\\{2,3\\right\\} & \\left\\{3,1\\right\\}\\\\\\left\\{1,3\\right\\} & \\left\\{2,1\\right\\} & \\left\\{3,2\\right\\}\\\\\\left\\{1,3\\right\\} & \\left\\{2,2\\right\\} & \\left\\{3,1\\right\\}\\\\\\left\\{1,3\\right\\} & \\left\\{2,3\\right\\} & \\left\\{3,3\\right\\}\\\\\\left\\{2,1\\right\\} & \\left\\{2,2\\right\\} & \\left\\{2,3\\right\\}\\\\\\left\\{3,1\\right\\} & \\left\\{3,2\\right\\} & \\left\\{3,3\\right\\}\\end{pmatrix} \\right. \\\\\n  &\\left. ,\\begin{pmatrix}\\left\\{2,6\\right\\} & 54\\\\\\left\\{3,7\\right\\} & 18\\end{pmatrix}\\right\\}\n\\end{aligned}",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
