  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "**Result 6b (first part).**\n- **Which choices work.** 72 of the 84 choices reproduce all twisted eigen-bras, each with its own ket factor $\\kappa_B$, which is read off from $M_{AB}=\\det N^R/\\langle\\Psi_{A,w}|\\Psi_{B,z}\\rangle$ having rank 1. The 12 that fail have all $i$ equal, all $j$ equal, or $(i,j)$ forming a permutation.\n- **Image dimensions.** 54 choices use only two of the $F_i$ and have a 6-dimensional image. The 18 that use all three have a 7-dimensional image, which is a single quadric hypersurface.\n\nThe cell below analyzes every working choice:\n- the quadrics vanishing on the image;\n- their value on generic rotations and on (I);\n- the extra component, found by scanning $a$ at fixed $b$, and the eigenkets it annihilates.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "analyzeR[R_, kap_] := Module[{φs, smp, ns, qf, gen, onI, aS, vR, killed},\n   φs = Chop[Expand[Table[detNR[R, SZ, B, f]/kap[[B]], {B, nS}] . ketInvT], 10^-40];\n   smp = Table[With[{v = φs /. Thread[fsym -> RandomReal[{-1, 1}, 12, WorkingPrecision -> 60]]}, v/Norm[v]], {60}];\n   ns = NullSpace[Table[mons2 /. Thread[ph -> s], {s, smp}], Tolerance -> 10^-30];\n   qf = Function[φ, Max[Abs[Table[q . (mons2 /. Thread[ph -> φ/Norm[φ]]), {q, ns}]]]];\n   gen = Min[Table[qf[randOrb], {4}]]; onI = Max[Table[qf[momOrb], {3}]];\n   (* extra component: for random b, the a's (⟂ b) on which all quadrics vanish *)\n   aS = Flatten[Table[Module[{bv = RandomReal[{-1, 1}, 3, WorkingPrecision -> 60], nb, at, qs, sols},\n       nb = NullSpace[{bv}]; at = nb[[1]] + S1 nb[[2]];\n       qs = Expand[Table[q . (mons2 /. Thread[ph -> φAB[at, bv]]), {q, ns}]];\n       sols = NSolve[qs[[1]] == 0, S1, WorkingPrecision -> 40];\n       Normalize[at /. #] & /@ Select[sols, Max[Abs[qs /. #]]/Max[Abs[Flatten[CoefficientList[qs, S1]]]] < 10^-25 &]], {4}], 1];\n   vR = If[Length[aS] >= 2 && MatrixRank[aS, Tolerance -> 10^-20] == 2, With[{v = First[NullSpace[aS, Tolerance -> 10^-20]]}, v/v[[3]]], None];\n   killed = If[vR === None, None, With[{bv = RandomReal[{-1, 1}, 3, WorkingPrecision -> 60]}, With[{φ = φAB[Cross[bv, vR], bv]}, SZ[\"mu\"][[Flatten[Position[Abs[Table[φ . ketZ[[B]], {B, nS}]]/Norm[φ], _?(# < 10^-30 &)]]]]]]];\n   {R, Length[ns], N[gen, 3], N[onI, 3], If[vR === None, None, Chop[N[vR, 6], 10^-20]], killed}];\nSeedRandom[17];\nallR = Table[analyzeR[ri[[1]], ri[[3]]], {ri, goodR2}];\nchecks[\"6b: min over R of |quadrics| on generic rotations (nonzero)\"] = Min[allR[[All, 3]]];\nchecks[\"6b: max over R of |quadrics| on (I)\"] = Max[allR[[All, 4]]];\nTally[allR[[All, {2, 5, 6}]]]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
