   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "**Correction to Section 4b/4c.** At the numeric point, $z_3=2/3=1/z_1$. So $(1,z_1,z_1^2)\\propto m(1/z_1)=m(z_3)$, with $m(x)=(x^2,x,1)$. The row-choice scan shows the extra component is uniformly $a\\perp m(z_k)$, and it kills the two kets with $\\mu_k=0$. Component (II) of the canonical choice is therefore $a\\perp m(z_3)$.\n\nTwo checks follow:\n- **A second ket twist** $z'=(3/2,5/4,3/7)$, where $z_3'\\neq1/z_1'$. This separates the two readings.\n- **The 7-dimensional choices**, with the double root resolved by restricting the quadric to the orbit and dividing out $b_1b_3-b_2^2$.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* (i) second ket twist: canonical rows, does the extra piece follow m(z3') or (1,z1',z1'^2)? *)\nzP = {3/2, 5/4, 3/7};\nSZp = stateData[zP]; ketZp = Table[v/(x0N . v), {v, SZp[\"vecR\"]}]; ketInvTp = Inverse[Transpose[ketZp]];\nφFp = Chop[Expand[Table[detNF[SZp, B, f]/psiQ[SZp, B], {B, nS}] . ketInvTp], 10^-40];\nSeedRandom[19];\nsmpP = Table[With[{v = φFp /. Thread[fsym -> RandomReal[{-1, 1}, 12, WorkingPrecision -> 60]]}, v/Norm[v]], {80}];\nnsP = NullSpace[Table[mons2 /. Thread[ph -> s], {s, smpP}], Tolerance -> 10^-30];\nqP2[φ_] := Max[Abs[Table[q . (mons2 /. Thread[ph -> φ/Norm[φ]]), {q, nsP}]]];\nmV[x_] := {x^2, x, 1};\ntestVec[v_] := Max[Table[With[{bv = RandomReal[{-1, 1}, 3, WorkingPrecision -> 60]}, qP2[φAB[Cross[bv, N[v, prec]], bv]]], {4}]];\nchecks[\"6b: z' twist, quadrics on a ⟂ m(z3')\"] = testVec[mV[zP[[3]]]];\nchecks[\"6b: z' twist, quadrics on a ⟂ (1,z1',z1'^2) (nonzero)\"] = testVec[{1, zP[[1]], zP[[1]]^2}];\nchecks[\"6b: z' twist, quadrics on (I)\"] = Max[Table[qP2[momOrb], {4}]];\nchecks[\"6b: z' twist, a ⟂ m(z3') kills the mu3=0 kets\"] = With[{bv = RandomReal[{-1, 1}, 3, WorkingPrecision -> 60]}, With[{φ = φAB[Cross[bv, N[mV[zP[[3]]], prec]], bv]}, Max[Abs[Table[φ . ketZp[[B]], {B, Flatten[Position[SZp[\"mu\"], {_, _, 0}]]}]]]/Norm[φ]]];\n(* (ii) 7-dim choices: which m(z_k) divides the quadric on the orbit *)\nwhichK7 = Table[Module[{R = ri[[1]], kap = ri[[3]], φs, smp, q1, vals},\n    φs = Chop[Expand[Table[detNR[R, SZ, B, f]/kap[[B]], {B, nS}] . ketInvT], 10^-40];\n    smp = Table[With[{v = φs /. Thread[fsym -> RandomReal[{-1, 1}, 12, WorkingPrecision -> 60]]}, v/Norm[v]], {60}];\n    q1 = First[NullSpace[Table[mons2 /. Thread[ph -> s], {s, smp}], Tolerance -> 10^-30]];\n    vals = Table[Max[Table[With[{bv = RandomReal[{-1, 1}, 3, WorkingPrecision -> 60]}, With[{φ = φAB[Cross[bv, N[mV[z[k] /. pt], prec]], bv]}, Abs[q1 . (mons2 /. Thread[ph -> φ/Norm[φ]])]]], {3}]], {k, 3}];\n    {R, Flatten[Position[vals, _?(# < 10^-30 &)]]}], {ri, Select[goodR2, MemberQ[r18, #[[1]]] &]}];\nchecks[\"6b: every 7-dim choice has exactly one a ⟂ m(z_k) piece\"] = AllTrue[whichK7[[All, 2]], Length[#] == 1 &];\n{Tally[whichK7[[All, 2]]], KeyTake[checks, {\"6b: z' twist, quadrics on a ⟂ m(z3')\", \"6b: z' twist, quadrics on a ⟂ (1,z1',z1'^2) (nonzero)\", \"6b: z' twist, quadrics on (I)\", \"6b: z' twist, a ⟂ m(z3') kills the mu3=0 kets\", \"6b: every 7-dim choice has exactly one a ⟂ m(z_k) piece\"}]}",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {
    "toolId": "X43sZmlsZQ"
   }
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### 6c. Shift-operator × polynomial insertions, i.e. the twist torus\n- **Bra side.** An insertion acting on the bra-side $F$ in all columns gives nothing new, since $O F$ is just another $F$.\n- **Ket side.** On the ket's $Q^j$, the dual Baxter equation turns shifted $Q^j$ into transfer-matrix eigenvalues times $Q^j$. Such insertions are therefore operator insertions $\\varphi\\to\\varphi\\cdot f(t(z))$.\n- **The natural $f$.** We have $t_1(u)-(u-\\theta)\\chi_1=h\\,\\rho_{\\rm Lie}(G(z)^T)$. So the twist torus $\\eta=p(G^T)$, with $p(x)=c_0+c_1x+c_2x^2$, commutes with every $t(z)$. On $\\Psi_B$ it is diagonal, with eigenvalue $\\prod_ip(z_i)^{\\mu_i(B)}$ (to be checked).\n- **Claim to test.** Every rotation is $\\varphi_I\\,\\rho(\\eta)$, with $\\varphi_I$ in component (I) and $\\eta$ in the torus. Then $\\langle e_8|\\rho(g)|\\Psi_B\\rangle=\\prod_ip(z_i)^{\\mu_i}\\cdot\\det N[Q_B,Q_{A,w}]/(\\dots)$: a single determinant times a polynomial in the twist eigenvalues raised to the weights.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "Gz = N[Gc[zs] /. pt, prec]; zN = N[zs /. pt, prec];\nmV[x_] := {x^2, x, 1};\nchecks[\"6c: t1(u) - (u-θ)χ1 = h ρ_Lie(G^T)\"] = maxc[N[tGz[[1]] /. pt, prec] - N[(u - thN) (χ[zs][[1]] /. pt) IdentityMatrix[8], prec] - hN Sum[Gz[[k, i]] N[Ee[i, k], prec], {i, 3}, {k, 3}], u];\n(* one numeric torus element: ρ(p(G^T)) acts on Psi_B by prod p(z_i)^mu_i *)\nρG[m_] := MatrixExp[Sum[MatrixLog[m][[i, k]] N[Ee[i, k], prec], {i, 3}, {k, 3}]];\npTest = {1, 3/10, -1/7}; ηTest = pTest . {IdentityMatrix[3], Transpose[Gz], Transpose[Gz] . Transpose[Gz]};\nρη = ρG[ηTest];\npz = Table[pTest . {1, zN[[i]], zN[[i]]^2}, {i, 3}];\nchecks[\"6c: ρ(p(G^T)) Psi_B = prod p(z_i)^mu_i Psi_B\"] = Max[Table[Norm[ρη . ketZ[[B]] - Times @@ (pz^SZ[\"mu\"][[B]]) ketZ[[B]]]/Norm[ketZ[[B]]], {B, nS}]];\n(* rho = adj x det, so X transforms by conjugation up to a det factor *)\nchecks[\"6c: X(φ ρ(η)) ∝ η^-1 X η (det factor, adj⊗det)\"] = Module[{φ = φAB[{1, -2, 1}, {1, 1, 1}], X0, X1, Y}, X0 = Xof[φ] /. h -> hN; X1 = Xof[φ . ρη] /. h -> hN; Y = Inverse[ηTest] . X0 . ηTest; Max[Abs[Flatten[X1 - (Flatten[X1] . Flatten[Y]/Flatten[Y] . Flatten[Y]) Y]]]];\n(* decompose a generic rotation: b = Σ βc_i m(z_i); choose q(z1)=1, q(z2)=s, solve q(z3) so that q(G) b is on the moment curve *)\nbc = LinearSolve[Transpose[mV /@ zN], bG];\nmom[v_] := v[[1]] v[[3]] - v[[2]]^2;\nsQ = 7/5;\nr3 = Module[{r}, r /. First[NSolve[mom[Transpose[mV /@ zN] . ({1, sQ, r} bc)] == 0, r, WorkingPrecision -> 50]]];\nqv = {1, sQ, r3};                          (* q(z_i), with η^-1 = q(G^T) *)\nbI6 = Transpose[mV /@ zN] . (qv bc);       (* b' = q(G) b, on the moment curve *)\nqOp = Module[{x}, CoefficientList[InterpolatingPolynomial[Transpose[{zN, qv}], x], x]];\nηinvT = Sum[qOp[[k + 1]] MatrixPower[Transpose[Gz], k], {k, 0, Length[qOp] - 1}];\naI6 = Inverse[ηinvT] . aG;                  (* a' = η a *)\nβ6 = bI6[[2]]/bI6[[3]]; γ6 = -aI6[[2]]/aI6[[1]] - β6;\nchecks[\"6c: b' = q(G) b on moment curve\"] = Abs[mom[bI6]]/Norm[bI6]^2;\nchecks[\"6c: a' ⟂ b'\"] = Abs[aI6 . bI6]/(Norm[aI6] Norm[bI6]);\n(* the overlap of the generic rotation = prod p(z_i)^mu_i x overlap of a component-(I) covector, p = 1/q *)\nφI6 = φAB[aI6, bI6];\nratios = Table[(φG . ketZ[[B]])/((Times @@ ((1/qv)^SZ[\"mu\"][[B]])) (φI6 . ketZ[[B]])), {B, nS}];\nchecks[\"6c: <e8 ρ(g)|Psi_B> = prod p(z_i)^mu_i <φ_I|Psi_B> (B-independent ratio)\"] = Max[Abs[ratios/ratios[[1]] - 1]];\n(* and φ_I is a single det N with the Q's of the companion twist (α, β', γ'), any α *)\nφI6n = φI6/(φI6 . y0N);\nS6 = stateData[{13/10, β6, γ6}];\nbrs6 = Table[wv/(wv . y0N), {wv, S6[\"vecL\"]}];\nA6 = First[Ordering[Table[Norm[brs6[[A]] - φI6n], {A, nS}], 1]];\nchecks[\"6c: φ_I = eigen-bra of t(G(α,β',γ'))\"] = Norm[brs6[[A6]] - φI6n];\nchecks[\"6c: φ_I = det N[Q_B, Q_(α,β',γ')]\"] = With[{v = φF[Function[{i, m}, QD[S6, A6, i, thN + m hN]]]}, Norm[v/(v . y0N) - φI6n]];\n{N[{β6, γ6}, 6], KeyTake[checks, Select[Keys[checks], StringStartsQ[#, \"6c\"] &]]}",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"485294\" data-output-id=\"113\" data-out-n=\"1581\" data-sub-idx=\"35\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"30\" data-sub-start=\"35\" data-sub-end=\"35\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[1581]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"21\" data-line-broken=\"1\" data-latex-b64=\"\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:7.5723em;vertical-align:-3.5362em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"col-align-r\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:4.0362em;\"><span style=\"top:-6.0603em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.8641em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.5362em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.8641em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.0121em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.8641em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.5121em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.8641em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:0.0121em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.8641em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.5362em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"col-align-l\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:4.0362em;\"><span style=\"top:-6.1962em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"