ss=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.05278em;\">β</span><span class=\"mord\">’,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.05556em;\">γ</span><span class=\"mord\">’))</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">6c: </span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">φ</span><span class=\"mord\">_I = det N[Q_B, Q_(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mord\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.05278em;\">β</span><span class=\"mord\">’,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.05556em;\">γ</span><span class=\"mord\">’)]</span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.6479em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">6c: X(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">φ</span><span class=\"mord\"> </span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"mord\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.03588em;\">η</span><span class=\"mord\">)) </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∝</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"> </span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.03588em;\">η</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˆ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">-1 X </span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.03588em;\">η</span><span class=\"mord\"> (det factor, adj</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⊗</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">det)</span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-0.1238em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">57</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mclose\">⟩</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">}</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.5362em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "Out[1581]= \\begin{aligned}\n  &\\left\\{\\left\\{0.856503,0.920496\\right\\},\\langle\\! \\right. \\\\\n  &\\left. \\lvert \\text{6c: t1(u) - (u-$\\theta$)$\\chi$1 = h $\\rho$\\_Lie(G\\^{}T)}\\to 0,\\text{6c: $\\rho$(p(G\\^{}T)) Psi\\_B = prod p(z\\_i)\\^{}mu\\_i Psi\\_B}\\to 0,\\text{6c: b' = q(G) b on moment curve}\\to 0.\\times 10^{-50},\\text{6c: a' $\\perp$ b'}\\to 0.\\times 10^{-48},\\text{6c: <e8 $\\rho$(g)|Psi\\_B> = prod p(z\\_i)\\^{}mu\\_i <$\\varphi$\\_I|Psi\\_B> (B-independent ratio)} \\right. \\\\\n  &\\left. \\to 0.\\times 10^{-44},\\text{6c: $\\varphi$\\_I = eigen-bra of t(G($\\alpha$,$\\beta$',$\\gamma$'))}\\to 0,\\text{6c: $\\varphi$\\_I = det N[Q\\_B, Q\\_($\\alpha$,$\\beta$',$\\gamma$')]} \\right. \\\\\n  &\\left. \\to 0,\\text{6c: X($\\varphi$ $\\rho$($\\eta$)) $\\propto$ $\\eta$\\^{}-1 X $\\eta$ (det factor, adj$\\otimes$det)} \\right. \\\\\n  &\\left. \\to 0.\\times 10^{-57}\\rvert\\!\\rangle \\right\\}\n\\end{aligned}",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
     ],
     "id": "299489e6-3200-4a78-9b8f-8ac954318872"
    }
   ],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "**Result 6c.** Every rotation is a torus image of a companion eigen-bra: $e_8^T\\rho(g)=\\varphi_I\\,\\rho(p(G^T))$, with $p=1/q$ quadratic. Hence\n$$\\langle e_8|\\rho(g)|\\Psi_B\\rangle\\propto\\prod_ip(z_i)^{\\mu_i(B)}\\cdot\\frac{\\det N[Q_B,Q_{A,w}]}{\\Psi_Q^B(x_0)},\\qquad w=(\\alpha,\\beta',\\gamma').$$\n- **Freedom.** There is a one-parameter family of such splittings (here $q(z_1)=1$, $q(z_2)=7/5$, and $q(z_3)$ is solved for), and $\\alpha$ is free.\n- **The prefactor.** It is the eigenvalue of $\\rho(p(G^T))$, which commutes with all $t(z)$. Write $p\\propto(1+r_1x)(1+r_2x)$ and $\\prod_i(1+rz_i)^{\\mu_i}=\\sum_kr^ke_k$, where $e_k$ is the elementary symmetric function of the multiset $\\{z_i^{\\times\\mu_i}\\}$, so $e_1=t_1(\\theta)/h$.\n- **Test below.** Are $e_2$ and $e_3$ linear in transfer-matrix eigenvalues, so that the prefactor is an explicit $T_\\lambda$ (Casoratian, i.e. shift-operator) insertion?",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* CBR fused eigenvalues, verbatim from the clean notebook (Section 5) *)\ncbrT[tt_, lam_, v_] := Module[{lp = DeleteCases[lam, 0], n, lc, ta},\n  ta[a_, yy_] := Which[a == 0, 1, a < 0 || a > 3, 0, True, tt[[a]] /. u -> yy];\n  n = If[lp === {}, 0, First[lp]]; lc = Table[Count[lp, _?(# >= j &)], {j, n}];\n  If[n == 0, 1, Expand[Det[Table[ta[lc[[j]] + i - j, v + (i - 1) hN], {i, n}, {j, n}]]]]];\nlamList = Select[Tuples[Range[0, 3], 3], #[[1]] >= #[[2]] >= #[[3]] && Total[#] > 0 &];\nek[mu_, k_] := SymmetricPolynomial[k, Flatten[Table[ConstantArray[zN[[i]], mu[[i]]], {i, 3}]]];\neVec = Table[ek[SZ[\"mu\"][[B]], k], {k, 0, 3}, {B, nS}];\n(* coefficient vectors (over the 8 states) of the T_λ(u) eigenvalues *)\ncoefVecs[lams_] := Flatten[Table[Transpose[Table[PadRight[CoefficientList[Chop[Expand[cbrT[SZ[\"vals\"][[B]], lam, u]], 10^-40], u], 10], {B, nS}]], {lam, lams}], 1];\ninSpan[v_, basis_] := Module[{bs = Select[basis, Norm[#] > 10^-30 &]}, Norm[Transpose[bs] . LeastSquares[Transpose[bs], v] - v]/Norm[v]];\nlam1 = {{1, 0, 0}}; lam2 = {{1, 0, 0}, {1, 1, 0}};\nchecks[\"6c: e1 ∈ span{1, t1 coeffs}\"] = inSpan[eVec[[2]], Join[{eVec[[1]]}, coefVecs[lam1]]];\nchecks[\"6c: e2 ∈ span{1, t1, t2 coeffs}\"] = inSpan[eVec[[3]], Join[{eVec[[1]]}, coefVecs[lam2]]];\nchecks[\"6c: e3 ∈ span{1, t1, t2 coeffs}\"] = inSpan[eVec[[4]], Join[{eVec[[1]]}, coefVecs[lam2]]];\nchecks[\"6c: e3 ∈ span{1, all T_λ coeffs, λ ⊆ 3x3}\"] = inSpan[eVec[[4]], Join[{eVec[[1]]}, coefVecs[lamList]]];\nchecks[\"6c: rank of span{1, all T_λ coeffs}\"] = MatrixRank[Select[Join[{eVec[[1]]}, coefVecs[lamList]], Norm[#] > 10^-30 &], Tolerance -> 10^-30];\nKeyTake[checks, Select[Keys[checks], StringStartsQ[#, \"6c: e\"] || StringStartsQ[#, \"6c: rank\"] &]]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"485294\" data-output-id=\"115\" data-out-n=\"1605\" data-sub-idx=\"14\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"32\" data-sub-start=\"17\" data-sub-end=\"17\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[1605]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"22\" data-line-broken=\"1\" data-latex-b64=\"\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:15em;vertical-align:-7.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"col-align-r\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:7.75em;\"><span style=\"top:-9.75em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.84em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-8.25em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.84em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-6.75em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.84em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-5.25em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.84em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.75em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.84em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.25em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.84em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-0.75em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.84em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:0.75em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.84em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:2.25em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.