  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* torus rotations: rho(p(G^T)) = sum_mu c_mu(p) O_mu as operators; c from the eigenvalues, sum_mu c_mu o_mu(B) = prod_i p(z_i)^mu_i(B) *)\nomuInv = Inverse[omu];\ncOfEig[ev_] := omuInv . ev;\ncTest = cOfEig[Table[Times @@ (pz^SZ[\"mu\"][[B]]), {B, nS}]];\nchecks[\"8: rho(p(G^T)) = sum c_mu O_mu (operator identity)\"] = Max[Abs[Flatten[ρη - Sum[cTest[[m]] Omu[gtpats[[m]]], {m, 8}]]]]/Max[Abs[Flatten[ρη]]];\n(* p = 1 + r x: c(r) = sum_k r^k c^(k), with c^(k) = o^-1 . e_k *)\nck = Table[Chop[cOfEig[eVec[[k + 1]]], 10^-40], {k, 0, 3}];\n(* identify the entries as rationals (pt is rational, h = 1/2) *)\nckR = Map[If[# == 0, 0, Rationalize[#, 10^-40]] &, ck, {2}];\nchecks[\"8: c^(k) rational at pt\"] = Max[Abs[Flatten[N[ckR, prec] - ck]]];\nchecks[\"8: c^(1) = (2 χ1, 1/h, 0, ...)\"] = Max[Abs[ck[[2]] - N[{2 (χ[zs][[1]] /. pt), 1/hN, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0}, prec]]];\nGrid[Prepend[Transpose[Prepend[ckR, gtpats]], {\"μ\", \"c^(0)\", \"c^(1)\", \"c^(2)\", \"c^(3)\"}], Frame -> All]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
