span style=\"top:-6.1051em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:7.6628em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-7.3102em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:7.6628em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-8.5153em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:7.6628em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-9.7153em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:7.6628em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-10.9204em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:7.6628em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-12.1255em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:7.6628em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-13.3255em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:7.6628em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:5.1628em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "Out[1635]= \\begin{array}{|c|c|c|c|c|}\\hline\\mu  & \\text{c\\^{}(0)} & \\text{c\\^{}(1)} & \\text{c\\^{}(2)} & \\text{c\\^{}(3)}\\\\\\hline\\left\\{\\left\\{2\\right\\},\\left\\{2,1\\right\\}\\right\\} & 1 & \\frac{41}{6} & \\frac{2215}{144} & \\frac{3649}{288}\\\\\\hline\\left\\{\\left\\{2\\right\\},\\left\\{1,1\\right\\}\\right\\} & 0 & 2 & \\frac{41}{6} & \\frac{89}{12}\\\\\\hline\\left\\{\\left\\{1\\right\\},\\left\\{1,1\\right\\}\\right\\} & 0 & 0 & 0 & 0\\\\\\hline\\left\\{\\left\\{2\\right\\},\\left\\{2,0\\right\\}\\right\\} & 0 & 0 & \\frac{41}{6} & \\frac{1147}{72}\\\\\\hline\\left\\{\\left\\{2\\right\\},\\left\\{1,0\\right\\}\\right\\} & 0 & 0 & 4 & \\frac{41}{3}\\\\\\hline\\left\\{\\left\\{2\\right\\},\\left\\{0,0\\right\\}\\right\\} & 0 & 0 & 0 & 4\\\\\\hline\\left\\{\\left\\{1\\right\\},\\left\\{1,0\\right\\}\\right\\} & 0 & 0 & 0 & \\frac{4}{3}\\\\\\hline\\left\\{\\left\\{1\\right\\},\\left\\{0,0\\right\\}\\right\\} & 0 & 0 & 0 & 0\\\\\\hline\\end{array}",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
