  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "**Result 8a.** $\\rho(1+rG^T)$ is an explicit finite combination of the SoV operators, cubic in $r$ with rational coefficients. For example $c^{(1)}=(2\\chi_1,1/h,0,\\dots)$, i.e. $\\rho_{\\rm Lie}(G^T)=t_1(\\theta-2h)/h+2\\chi_1$. $T_{11}$ and $T_{20}T_{21}T_{10}^{-1}$ never appear.\n\n**Closed form.**\n- The map $M\\mapsto e_1^TM$ is injective on the commutant of $t(z)$, which has dimension 8, and $e_1^TO_\\mu=\\langle x_\\mu|$.\n- Hence every $M$ that commutes with $t(z)$ is $\\sum_\\mu c_\\mu O_\\mu$, with $c$ the SoV coefficients of $e_1^TM$.\n- For $M=\\rho(\\eta)$ with $\\eta=p(G^T)$, $c$ is the Section 3 formula $c(a,b)$ for the rotated highest-weight covector $e_1^T\\rho(\\eta)$, i.e. $a\\propto\\eta^{-1}a_1$ and $b\\propto b_1\\eta$, where $X(e_1^T)=a_1b_1^T$.\n\nThe cell below checks this. It then tests whether $\\Omega\\sum c_\\mu O_\\mu$ can be a rotation for $c$ outside the torus family.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "XmatN = N[Xmat /. h -> hN, prec];\nX1 = Xof[UnitVector[8, 1]] /. h -> hN;\nchecks[\"8: X(e1^T) rank 1\"] = SingularValueList[X1, 2, Tolerance -> 0][[2]];\n(* c(η) = SoV coefficients of e1^T ρ(η) *)\nchecks[\"8: c(p) = SoV coefficients of e1^T ρ(p(G^T))\"] = Norm[cTest - (UnitVector[8, 1] . ρη) . Inverse[XmatN]]/Norm[cTest];\n(* generic rotation target: its c is NOT the SoV-coefficient vector of a rotation (X(e1^T M) not rank 1) *)\ncTarget = LinearSolve[Transpose[Ωbasis], φG];\nchecks[\"8: generic target: Ω Σ c O = target\"] = Norm[cTarget . Ωbasis - φG]/Norm[φG];\nchecks[\"8: generic target: X(Σ c <x|) 2nd/1st singular value (nonzero)\"] = With[{sv = SingularValueList[Xof[cTarget . XmatN] /. h -> hN, 3, Tolerance -> 0]}, sv[[2]]/sv[[1]]];\n(* conversely: c = SoV coefficients of a random rotation e1^T rho(g) (not torus): is Ω Σ c O a rotation? *)\nSeedRandom[23];\nnonTorus = Table[Module[{ωr = RandomReal[{-1, 1}, {3, 3}, WorkingPrecision -> 60], cR, Φ},\n    cR = (UnitVector[8, 1] . ρG[MatrixExp[ωr]]) . Inverse[XmatN];\n    Φ = cR . Ωbasis;\n    With[{sv = SingularValueList[Xof[Φ] /. h -> hN, 3, Tolerance -> 0]}, sv[[2]]/sv[[1]]]], {3}];\nchecks[\"8: c from non-torus e1^T rho(g): Ω Σ c O rank-1? (2nd sv, nonzero)\"] = Min[nonTorus];\n(* torus case: rank 1 *)\nchecks[\"8: torus c: Ω Σ c O = Ω ρ(η) rank 1\"] = With[{sv = SingularValueList[Xof[cTest . Ωbasis] /. h -> hN, 3, Tolerance -> 0]}, sv[[2]]/sv[[1]]];\nKeyTake[checks, Select[Keys[checks], StringStartsQ[#, \"8: X\"] || StringStartsQ[#, \"8: c(p)\"] || StringStartsQ[#, \"8: generic\"] || StringStartsQ[#, \"8: c from\"] || StringStartsQ[#, \"8: torus\"] &]]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"485294\" data-output-id=\"120\" data-out-n=\"1647\" data-sub-idx=\"15\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"40\" data-sub-start=\"18\" data-sub-end=\"18\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[1647]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"21\" data-line-broken=\"1\" data-latex-b64=\"\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:16.32em;vertical-align:-7.91em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"col-align-r\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:8.41em;\"><span style=\"top:-11.07em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.5em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-9.57em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.5em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-8.07em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.5em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-6.57em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.5em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-5.07em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.5em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.57em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.5em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.07em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.5em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-0.57em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.5em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:1.59em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.5em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:3.75em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.5em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:7.91em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"col-align-l\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:8.41em;\"><span style=\"top:-11.2575em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.6875em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">⟨</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">∣</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">8: X(e1</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˆ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">T) rank 1</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-9.7575em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.6875em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">8: c(p) = SoV coefficients of e1</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˆ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">T </span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"mord\">(p(G</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˆ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">T))</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-8.2575em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.6875em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">8: generic target: Ω Σ c O = target</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-6.7575em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.6875em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">8: generic target: X(Σ c &lt;x|) 2nd/1st singular value (nonzero)</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-5.2575em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.6875em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.017502088825418306734839165049662789681949109164382661555</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.7575em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.6875em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">8: c from non-torus e1</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˆ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">T rho(g): Ω Σ c O rank-1? (2nd sv, nonzero)</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.2575em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.6875em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.00622023770079056416218880562364076197797216166365016194470</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-0.7575em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.6875em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">8: torus c: Ω Σ c O = Ω </span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"mord\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.03588em;\">η</span><span class=\"mord\">) rank 1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:1.4025em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.6875em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2.405444660235607111283079428114</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\" style=\"color:gray;\"><span class=\"mord\" style=\"color:gray;\">⋮</span><span class=\"mord rule\" style=\"color:gray;border-right-width:0em;border-top-width:1.5em;bottom:0em;\"></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:3.5625em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.6875em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\" style=\"color:gray;\"><span class=\"mord\" style=\"color:gray;\">⋮</span><span class=\"mord rule\" style=\"color:gray;border-right-width:0em;border-top-width:1.5em;bottom:0em;\"></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">815304992845595588366662</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">69</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mclose\">⟩</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:7.91em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "Out[1647]= \\begin{aligned}\n  &\\langle\\!\\lvert \\text{8: X(e1\\^{}T) rank 1}\\to 0 \\\\\n  &,\\text{8: c(p) = SoV coefficients of e1\\^{}T $\\rho$(p(G\\^{}T))}\\to 0 \\\\\n  &,\\text{8: generic target: $\\Omega$ $\\Sigma$ c O = target} \\\\\n  &\\to 0,\\text{8: generic target: X($\\Sigma$ c <x|) 2nd/1st singular value (nonzero)} \\\\\n  &\\to 0.017502088825418306734839165049662789681949109164382661555 \\\\\n  &,\\text{8: c from non-torus e1\\^{}T rho(g): $\\Omega$ $\\Sigma$ c O rank-1? (2nd sv, nonzero)} \\\\\n  &\\to 0.00622023770079056416218880562364076197797216166365016194470 \\\\\n  &,\\text{8: torus c: $\\Omega$ $\\Sigma$ c O = $\\Omega$ $\\rho$($\\eta$) rank 1} \\\\\n  &\\to 2.405444660235607111283079428114{\\color{gray}\\vdots} \\\\\n  &{\\color{gray}\\vdots}815304992845595588366662\\times 10^{-69}\\rvert\\!\\rangle\n\\end{aligned}",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
