  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "**Result 8b.** With $\\Omega$ fixed, the structured coefficients $c=$ SoV coefficients of $e_1^T\\rho(\\eta)$ give rotations exactly when $\\eta$ is in the torus. Those rotations are the 3-dimensional family $\\Omega\\rho(p(G^T))$.\n- Rotation-shaped $c$ from non-torus $g$ do not give rotations.\n- A generic rotation needs an unstructured $c$, which exists because $\\{\\Omega O_\\mu\\}$ spans the whole space.\n\n**Moving the vacuum.** The remaining direction is $w$. Write $\\Omega_{w'}=\\Omega_w\\,M_{w'w}$, where $M_{w'w}$ is diagonal on $\\Psi_B$ with entries $\\Omega_{w'}\\cdot\\Psi_B/\\Omega_w\\cdot\\Psi_B$, a ratio of two $\\det N$'s. Is its $c$, i.e. $e_1^TM_{w'w}$, also structured (rank 1)?",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "vacBra[wv_] := Module[{S = stateData[wv], A0}, A0 = First[Flatten[Position[S[\"mu\"], {2, 1, 0}]]]; With[{vv = S[\"vecL\"][[A0]]}, vv/(vv . y0N)]];\nw2s = {{7/4, 2/5, 9/7}, {-3/2, 5/3, 4/5}};\nmoveW = Table[Module[{Ω2 = vacBra[w2], cW, sv},\n    cW = LinearSolve[Transpose[Ωbasis], Ω2];\n    sv = SingularValueList[Xof[cW . XmatN] /. h -> hN, 3, Tolerance -> 0];\n    {sv[[2]]/sv[[1]], sv[[3]]/sv[[1]]}], {w2, w2s}];\nchecks[\"8: e1^T M_{w'w} rank (2nd sv / 1st; nonzero means not rank 1)\"] = Min[moveW[[All, 1]]];\nN[moveW, 3]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"485294\" data-output-id=\"121\" data-out-n=\"1652\" data-sub-idx=\"4\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"42\" data-sub-start=\"7\" data-sub-end=\"7\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[1652]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"21\" data-latex-b64=\"XGJlZ2lue3BtYXRyaXh9MC4wMDIzNiAmIDAuMDAxMDhcXDAuMDM0NCAmIDAuMDA4NzJcZW5ke3BtYXRyaXh9\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4em;vertical-align:-0.95em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.45em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.61em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0.00236</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.41em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0.0344</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.95em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.45em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.61em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0.00108</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.41em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0.00872</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.95em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div></div>",
