  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "**Result 8c.** Changing $w$ is not a structured insertion: $e_1^TM_{w'w}$ is not rank 1.\n\n**Conclusion of Section 8.** Take $\\Omega=\\Omega_{z,w}$ and insert $\\sum_\\mu c_\\mu O_\\mu$, i.e. the same $t$-products that build the SoV basis.\n- **Factorized overlaps.** Every covector, hence every rotation, is $\\Omega\\sum c_\\mu O_\\mu$ for a unique $c$. The overlap always factorizes as $[\\sum_\\mu c_\\mu o_\\mu(B)]\\times\\det N$.\n- **Structured $c$.** When $c$ is the SoV coefficient vector of a rotated $e_1^T$, so of the Section 3 form $c(a,b)$, the result is a rotation exactly for the twist-torus rotations $\\Omega\\rho(p(G(z)^T))$.\n  - There $\\sum c_\\mu O_\\mu=\\rho(p(G^T))$ exactly, as a finite combination cubic in $p$ with rational coefficients (table in 8a), and $\\sum_\\mu c_\\mu o_\\mu(B)=\\prod_ip(z_i)^{\\mu_i}$.\n  - This is a 2-parameter (plus scale) enlargement of $\\Omega_{z,w}$, which is 3-dimensional inside the 4-dimensional orbit.\n- **Full orbit.** Adding the choice of $w$ covers every rotation (6c). However, the change of $w$ is itself not a structured insertion.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## 10. Products $\\langle x_0|M(w)M(y)$\n- **Setup.** Define $M(w)=\\sum_\\mu c_\\mu(w)O_\\mu$ by $\\langle x_0|M(w)=\\Omega_w$, so $c(w)$ is the vector of SoV coefficients of $\\Omega_w$. Here $\\Omega_w=e_1^TP_{pp}(w)$ is the companion vacuum; it depends only on $(w_1,w_2)$ and does not depend on $z$.\n- **Question.** For which $y$ is $\\langle x_0|M(w)M(y)=\\Omega_w M(y)$ proportional to a global rotation of $x_0$, i.e. rank 1?\n- **Symmetry.** The $M$'s commute, so the product is symmetric in $w\\leftrightarrow y$.\n- **Expected trivial solutions.** For $y=\\sigma(z)$, $\\Omega_y$ is an eigen-bra of $t(z)$ itself. Then $M(y)$ is a rank-1 projector and the product is $\\propto\\Omega_{\\sigma z}$, independent of $w$.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "PppOf[y_] := MatrixExp[(1/y[[1]]) N[Ee[1, 2], prec]] . MatrixExp[-(1/(y[[1]] y[[2]])) N[Ee[1, 3], prec]] . MatrixExp[((y[[1]] + y[[2]])/(y[[1]] y[[2]])) N[Ee[2, 3], prec]];\nΩv[y_] := UnitVector[8, 1] . PppOf[N[y, prec]];\nchecks[\"10: Ωv[w] ∝ w-vacuum bra (braW)\"] = Norm[Ωv[ws /. pt]/(Ωv[ws /. pt] . y0N) - Ωc];\nOlist = Table[Omu[μ], {μ, gtpats}];\nMof[y_] := With[{c = Ωv[y] . Inverse[XmatN]}, c . Olist];\nchecks[\"10: <x0|M(y) = Ω_y\"] = With[{y = {2/3, -5/4, 7/5}}, Norm[UnitVector[8, 1] . Mof[y] - Ωv[y]]/Norm[Ωv[y]]];\nchecks[\"10: [M(w), M(y)] = 0\"] = With[{a = Mof[ws /. pt], b = Mof[{2/3, -5/4, 7/5}]}, Max[Abs[Flatten[a . b - b . a]]]/Max[Abs[Flatten[a . b]]]];\ndefect[φ_] := With[{sv = SingularValueList[Xof[φ] /. h -> hN, 3, Tolerance -> 0]}, sv[[2]]/sv[[1]]];\nΦwy[w_, y_] := Ωv[w] . Mof[y];\nwN = ws /. pt;\n(* trivial solutions: y = permutations of z give Ω_{σ z}, independent of w *)\ntriv = Table[{σ, defect[Φwy[wN, zN[[σ]]]], Norm[Normalize[Φwy[wN, zN[[σ]]]] - Normalize[Ωv[zN[[σ]]]] Sign[Normalize[Φwy[wN, zN[[σ]]]][[1]]/Normalize[Ωv[zN[[σ]]]][[1]]]]}, {σ, Permutations[{1, 2, 3}]}];\nchecks[\"10: y = σ(z): rank 1\"] = Max[triv[[All, 2]]];\nchecks[\"10: y = σ(z): ∝ Ω_{σ z}\"] = Max[triv[[All, 3]]];\nSeedRandom[31];\nchecks[\"10: random y: min defect (nonzero)\"] = Min[Table[defect[Φwy[wN, RandomComplex[{-2 - 2 I, 2 + 2 I}, 3, WorkingPrecision -> 60]]], {20}]];\nchecks[\"10: y = w: defect (nonzero)\"] = defect[Φwy[wN, wN]];\nKeyTake[checks, Select[Keys[checks], StringStartsQ[#, \"10:\"] &]]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"485294\" data-output-id=\"124\" data-out-n=\"1687\" data-sub-idx=\"18\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"45\" data-sub-start=\"18\" data-sub-end=\"18\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[1687]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"21\" data-line-broken=\"1\" data-latex-b64=\"\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:17.8682em;vertical-align:-8.6841em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"col-align-r\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:9.1841em;\"><span style=\"top:-11.8441em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.5em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-10.3441em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.5em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-8.82em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.5em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-7.32em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.5em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-5.82em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.5em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.2959em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.5em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.7959em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.5em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.2959em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.5em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:0.2041em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" s