  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "KeyDropFrom[checks, {\"10: y = w: defect\"}];\n(* exact solve: Ω_y is polynomial in s1 = 1/y1, s2 = 1/y2 (nilpotent exponentials) *)\nΩs = Expand[UnitVector[8, 1] . MatrixExp[s1 Ee[1, 2]] . MatrixExp[-s1 s2 Ee[1, 3]] . MatrixExp[(s1 + s2) Ee[2, 3]]];\nchecks[\"10: Ωs(1/y) = Ωv(y)\"] = With[{y = {2/3, -5/4, 7/5}}, Norm[(Ωs /. {s1 -> 1/y[[1]], s2 -> 1/y[[2]]}) - Ωv[y]]];\nΦs = Expand[Ωv[wN] . ((Ωs . Inverse[XmatN]) . Olist)];\nXs = Expand[Xof[Φs] /. h -> hN];\nminorsS = DeleteCases[Chop[Expand[Flatten[Minors[Xs, 2]]], 10^-40], 0];\nnrmP[p_] := p/Max[Abs[Flatten[CoefficientList[p, {s1, s2}]]]];\nminorsS = nrmP /@ minorsS;\n(* pairs of minors; positive-dimensional components (lines) only show up as single representatives here *)\npairSols = Flatten[Table[Quiet[NSolve[{minorsS[[i]] == 0, minorsS[[j]] == 0}, {s1, s2}, WorkingPrecision -> 40]], {i, 1, 3}, {j, i + 1, 4}], 2];\ngoodS = DeleteDuplicatesBy[Select[pairSols, Max[Abs[minorsS /. #]] < 10^-20 &], Round[{s1, s2} /. #, 10^-10] &];\n{N[{s1, s2} /. goodS, 6], N[1/zN, 6]}",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
