  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* line components: y1 = z_k (any y2). Omega_y then kills 6 kets; the two survivors (mu_k = 2) give eigen-bras with a common a = l_k, so every combination is rank 1 *)\nkilledOn[y_] := SZ[\"mu\"][[Flatten[Position[Abs[Table[Ωv[y] . ketZ[[B]], {B, nS}]]/Norm[Ωv[y]], _?(# < 10^-30 &)]]]];\nSeedRandom[41];\nchecks[\"10: line y1 = z_k: rank 1 for random y2\"] = Max[Table[defect[Φwy[wN, {zN[[k]], RandomComplex[{-2 - 2 I, 2 + 2 I}, WorkingPrecision -> 60], 1}]], {k, 3}, {2}]];\nchecks[\"10: line y1 = z_k: minors vanish identically\"] = Max[Table[Max[Abs[Flatten[CoefficientList[Chop[Expand[minorsS /. s1 -> 1/zN[[k]]], 10^-30], s2]]], 0], {k, 3}]];\nlineKill = Table[{k, Complement[SZ[\"mu\"], killedOn[{zN[[k]], -1.1`60, 1}]]}, {k, 3}];\n(* remove the line factors and solve the rest with all pairs of minors *)\nlineFac = Times @@ Table[s1 - 1/zN[[k]], {k, 3}];\nredMinors = Table[Module[{q = m, r}, Do[{r} = {PolynomialReduce[q, {s1 - 1/zN[[k]]}, {s1, s2}]}; If[Max[Abs[Flatten[CoefficientList[Chop[r[[2]], 10^-25], {s1, s2}]]], 0] < 10^-25, q = Chop[Expand[r[[1, 1]]], 10^-30]], {k, 3}, {3}]; nrmP[q]], {m, minorsS}];\nredMinors = DeleteCases[redMinors, _?NumericQ];\nallPairs2 = Flatten[Table[Quiet[NSolve[{redMinors[[i]] == 0, redMinors[[j]] == 0}, {s1, s2}, WorkingPrecision -> 40]], {i, 1, Length[redMinors]}, {j, i + 1, Length[redMinors]}], 2];\nisoS = DeleteDuplicatesBy[Select[allPairs2, Max[Abs[minorsS /. #]] < 10^-20 && Min[Abs[(s1 /. #) - 1/zN]] > 10^-10 &], Round[{s1, s2} /. #, 10^-8] &];\n{lineKill, Length[redMinors], N[{s1, s2} /. isoS, 6]}",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
