   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "**Result 10b. Yes: generic raising exponentials are reached.**\n- **Generic local surjection.** The map $(w_1,w_2,y_1)\\mapsto\\big[\\Omega_w\\,\\rho\\big((y_1-G(z)^T)^{-1}\\big)\\big]$ has Jacobian rank 3, while $(w_1,w_2)$ alone gives rank 2. The resolvent direction is therefore transverse to the $\\Omega_w$ family.\n- **Explicit solves.** For three random complex $(p,q,r)$, FindRoot finds $(w_1,w_2,y_1)$ with\n$$\\langle x_0|M(w)M(y_1,\\infty)\\ \\propto\\ x_0\\,\\rho\\big(e^{pE_{12}}e^{qE_{13}}e^{rE_{23}}\\big),$$\n  exact to $10^{-38}$. The solutions $(w,y_1)$ are complex in general.\n- **Conclusion.** Every global rotation of $x_0$ (generic point of its 3-dimensional orbit) is $\\Omega_w$ followed by the resolvent insertion $M(y_1,\\infty)$. Equivalently, it is the product of two vacuum-building SoV $t$-sums, with the second taken at $y_2=\\infty$.\n- **Not done.** The number of solutions (the degree of the map), the reality conditions, and closed forms for $(w,y_1)$ in terms of $(p,q,r)$.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### 10c. Which SoV operators survive at $y_2=\\infty$\nThe exact coefficients $c(y)$, the SoV coefficients of $\\Omega_y$, are free of $z$, with $s_i=1/y_i$:\n\n| $\\mu$ | $O_\\mu$ (at $\\theta-2h$) | $c_\\mu(y)$ | at $y_2=\\infty$ |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| {2\\|21} | $1$ | $1$ | $1$ |\n| {2\\|11} | $T_{10}$ | $s_1/h$ | $s_1/h$ |\n| {1\\|11} | $T_{11}$ | $s_1^2/2h^2$ | $s_1^2/2h^2$ |\n| {2\\|20} | $T_{20}T_{10}^{-1}$ | $s_2/h$ | 0 |\n| {2\\|10} | $T_{20}$ | $s_1(s_1+2s_2)/2h^2$ | $s_1^2/2h^2$ |\n| {2\\|00} | $T_{20}^2T_{10}^{-1}$ | $s_1^2s_2/2h^3$ | 0 |\n| {1\\|10} | $T_{20}T_{10}^{-1}T_{11}$ | $s_1^2(2s_1+3s_2)/6h^3$ | $s_1^3/3h^3$ |\n| {1\\|00} | $T_{20}T_{10}^{-1}T_{21}$ | $s_1^3s_2/3h^4$ | 0 |\n\n**Resolvent identity, for any ket twist $z$:**\n$$\\rho\\big((1-sG(z)^T)^{-1}\\big)\\ \\propto\\ 1+\\frac{s}{h}T_{10}+\\frac{s^2}{2h^2}\\big(T_{11}+T_{20}\\big)+\\frac{s^3}{3h^3}\\,T_{20}T_{10}^{-1}T_{11}.$$\nIt is checked below at two ket twists.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "cExact = Simplify[Expand[(Ωs /. s2 -> 0) . Inverse[Xmat]]];\ncGen = Factor[Simplify[Expand[Ωs . Inverse[Xmat]]]];\nchecks[\"10c: c(y) free of z\"] = FreeQ[cGen, z];\n(* resolvent identity at a ket twist zz (numeric O's rebuilt there) *)\nresolventCheck[zz_, sv_] := Module[{rep = Join[Thread[zs -> zz], {h -> hN, θ -> thN}], T10, T11, T20, Mlhs, G, R, k},\n   T10 = N[tF[{1, 0}, θ - 2 h] /. rep, prec]; T11 = N[tF[{1, 1}, θ - 2 h] /. rep, prec]; T20 = N[tF[{2, 0}, θ - 2 h] /. rep, prec];\n   Mlhs = IdentityMatrix[8] + (sv/hN) T10 + (sv^2/(2 hN^2)) (T11 + T20) + (sv^3/(3 hN^3)) T20 . Inverse[T10] . T11;\n   G = N[Gc[zz], prec]; R = ρG[Inverse[IdentityMatrix[3] - sv Transpose[G]]];\n   k = (Flatten[Mlhs] . Conjugate[Flatten[R]])/(Flatten[R] . Conjugate[Flatten[R]]); Max[Abs[Flatten[Mlhs - k R]]]/Max[Abs[Flatten[Mlhs]]]];\nchecks[\"10c: resolvent identity, z and z', several s\"] = Max[Table[resolventCheck[zz, sv], {zz, {zs /. pt, {3/2, 5/4, 3/7}}}, {sv, {1/3, -7/10, 1/5 + I/4}}]];\n{Thread[gtpats -> cExact], KeyTake[checks, {\"10c: c(y) free of z\", \"10c: resolvent identity, z and z', several s\"}]}",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"485294\" data-output-id=\"132\" data-out-n=\"1772\" data-sub-idx=\"6\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"55\" data-sub-start=\"10\" data-sub-end=\"10\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[1772]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"21\" data-line-broken=\"1\" data-latex-b64=\"\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:13.4195em;vertical-align:-6.4597em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"col-align-r\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:6.9597em;\"><span style=\"top:-9.0009em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.4911em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-6.2597em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.4911em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.7826em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.4911em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.3055em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.4911em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:0.7845em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.4911em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:2.3086em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.4911em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:6.4597em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"col-align-l\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"