  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### 10d. How $\\det Q(y)$ degenerates as $y_2\\to\\infty$\nWith $\\langle x_0|\\Psi_B\\rangle=1$,\n$$\\langle x_0|M(w)M(y)|\\Psi_B\\rangle=(\\Omega_w\\cdot\\Psi_B)(\\Omega_y\\cdot\\Psi_B)\\propto\\frac{\\det N[Q_B,Q_{{\\rm vac},w}]}{\\Psi_Q^B(x_0)}\\cdot\\frac{\\det N[Q_B,Q_{{\\rm vac},y}]}{\\Psi_Q^B(x_0)}.$$\n- **Which Q's enter.** Only $F_1=Q_1=y_1^{-u/h}$ ($\\deg q_1=0$) and $F_2=Q_2=y_2^{-u/h}q_2$ ($\\deg q_2=1$) of the $y$-vacuum enter.\n- **Concentration.** $F_2$ is probed at $\\theta+mh$ for $m=-2,\\dots,1$ with weights $y_2^{-m}$, so as $y_2\\to\\infty$ it concentrates on $\\theta-2h$.\n- **The limiting row.** The row $(i,j)=(2,3)$ becomes $w_2\\,(-P^3(\\theta-2h),\\,0,\\,P^3(\\theta-3h))$, where $w_2$ is the bracket weight at $n=2$.\n- **Prediction.** $\\det N_\\infty[Q_B;y_1]/\\Psi_Q^B(x_0)\\propto\\prod_i(1-z_i/y_1)^{-\\mu_i}$, the eigenvalue of the resolvent.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* (i) finite y: Omega_y.Psi_B ∝ det N[Q_B, Q_vac,y]/Psi_Q^B(x0), B-independent ratio *)\nvacDirect[yv_] := Module[{S = stateData[yv], A0}, A0 = First[Flatten[Position[S[\"mu\"], {2, 1, 0}]]]; {S, A0}];\nratioCheck[yv_] := Module[{S, A0, Fv, r}, {S, A0} = vacDirect[yv]; Fv = Function[{i, m}, QD[S, A0, i, thN + m hN]];\n   r = Table[(Ωv[yv] . ketZ[[B]])/(detNF[SZ, B, Fv]/psiQ[SZ, B]), {B, nS}]; Max[Abs[r/r[[1]] - 1]]];\nchecks[\"10d: Ω_y.Psi_B ∝ det N[Q_B, Q_vac,y]/Psi_Q(x0) (y finite)\"] = Max[Table[ratioCheck[yv], {yv, {wN, {-6/5, 9/4, 4/7}}}]];\n(* (ii) the vacuum F2 = Q2 as y2 grows: the root of q2 -> θ-2h, and F2 at θ+m h (m=-2..1) relative to m=-2 tends to (1, 1/y1, 0, 0) *)\nkapData = Table[Module[{S, A0, v, r}, {S, A0} = vacDirect[{y1v, 10^8, 4/7}]; v = Table[QD[S, A0, 2, thN + m hN], {m, -2, 1}];\n    r = X /. First[NSolve[S[\"qd\"][[A0, 2]] == 0, X, WorkingPrecision -> 30]]; {y1v, r - (thN - 2 hN), v/v[[1]] - {1, 1/y1v, 0, 0}}], {y1v, {-6/5, 3, 5/7 + I/3}}];\nchecks[\"10d: y2 -> ∞: root of q2 -> θ-2h\"] = Max[Abs[kapData[[All, 2]]]];\nchecks[\"10d: y2 -> ∞: F2 -> F1 on {θ-2h, θ-h}, 0 on {θ, θ+h}\"] = Max[Abs[Flatten[kapData[[All, 3]]]]];\n(* (iii) limiting det: F1 = y1^(-x/h), F2 = y1^(-x/h)/Γ((θ-x)/h) (= F1 at θ-2h, θ-h; 0 at θ, θ+h); common y1^(-θ/h) dropped *)\nFvInf[y1v_] := Function[{i, m}, Which[i == 1, N[y1v^(-m), prec], i == 2, If[MemberQ[{-2, -1}, m], N[y1v^(-m), prec], 0], True, 0]];\nlimCheck[y1v_] := Module[{r = Table[(detNF[SZ, B, FvInf[y1v]]/psiQ[SZ, B])/(Times @@ ((1 - zN/y1v)^(-SZ[\"mu\"][[B]]))), {B, nS}]}, Max[Abs[r/r[[1]] - 1]]];\nchecks[\"10d: det N_∞[Q_B; y1]/Psi_Q(x0) ∝ prod (1 - z_i/y1)^-mu_i\"] = Max[Table[limCheck[y1v], {y1v, {-6/5, 3, 5/7 + I/3}}]];\nchecks[\"10d: det N_∞ ∝ Ω_(y1,∞).Psi_B\"] = Module[{r = Table[(detNF[SZ, B, FvInf[-6/5]]/psiQ[SZ, B])/(((Ωs /. {s1 -> -5/6, s2 -> 0}) . ketZ[[B]])), {B, nS}]}, Max[Abs[r/r[[1]] - 1]]];\n(* the full product: <x0|M(w)M(y1,∞)|Psi_B> ∝ det N[Q_B, Q_vac,w] det N_∞[Q_B; y1]/Psi_Q(x0)^2 *)\nchecks[\"10d: <x0|M(w)M(y1,∞)|Psi> ∝ det N(w) det N_∞(y1)\"] = Module[{S, A0, Fw, r}, {S, A0} = vacDirect[wN]; Fw = Function[{i, m}, QD[S, A0, i, thN + m hN]];\n   r = Table[(Ωv[wN] . Ms0[-5/6] . ketZ[[B]])/(detNF[SZ, B, Fw] detNF[SZ, B, FvInf[-6/5]]/psiQ[SZ, B]^2), {B, nS}]; Max[Abs[r/r[[1]] - 1]]];\nKeyTake[checks, Select[Keys[checks], StringStartsQ[#, \"10d\"] &]]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"485294\" data-output-id=\"134\" data-out-n=\"1794\" data-sub-idx=\"15\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"57\" data-sub-start=\"18\" data-sub-end=\"18\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[1794]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"21\" data-line-broken=\"1\" data-latex-b64=\"\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:15.1446em;vertical-align:-7.3223em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"col-align-r\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:7.8223em;\"><span style=\"top:-9.8464em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.8641em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-8.3223em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.8641em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-6.8223em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.8641em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-5.2982em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.8641em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.7741em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.8641em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.25em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.8641em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-0.75em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.8641em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:0.7741em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.8641em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:2.2741em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.8641em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:3.7982em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.8641em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:7.3223em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"col-align-l\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:7.8223em;\"><span style=\"top:-9.9823em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">⟨</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">∣</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">10d: Ω_y.Psi_B </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∝</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"> det N[Q_B, Q_vac,y]/Psi_Q(x0) (y finite)</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-8.4582em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">54</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-6.9582em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">10d: det N_∞[Q_B; y1]/Psi_Q(x0) </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∝</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"> prod (1 - z_i/y1)</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˆ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">-mu_i</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-5.4341em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">54</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">10d: det N_∞ </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∝</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"> Ω_(y1,∞).Psi_B</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.91em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">54</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">10d: y2 -&gt; ∞: root of q2 -&gt; </span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.02778em;\">θ</span><span class=\"mord\">-2h</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.3859em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.500000045000001350000</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">8</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-0.8859em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">10d: y2 -&gt; ∞: F2 -&gt; F1 on {</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.02778em;\">θ</span><span class=\"mord\">-2h, </span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.02778em;\">θ</span><span class=\"mord\">-h}, 0 on {</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.02778em;\">θ</span><span class=\"mord\">, </span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.02778em;\">θ</span><span class=\"mord\">+h}</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:0.6382em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2.537312782924911818594650497299231814760097155432</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">8</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:2.1382em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">10d: &lt;x0|M(w)M(y1,∞)|Psi&gt; </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∝</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"> det N(w) det N_∞(y1)</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:3.6623em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">54</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mclose\">⟩</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:7.3223em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "Out[1794]= \\begin{aligned}\n  &\\langle\\!\\lvert \\text{10d: $\\Omega$\\_y.Psi\\_B $\\propto$ det N[Q\\_B, Q\\_vac,y]/Psi\\_Q(x0) (y finite)} \\\\\n  &\\to 0.\\times 10^{-54} \\\\\n  &,\\text{10d: det N\\_$\\infty$[Q\\_B; y1]/Psi\\_Q(x0) $\\propto$ prod (1 - z\\_i/y1)\\^{}-mu\\_i} \\\\\n  &\\to 0.\\times 10^{-54},\\text{10d: det N\\_$\\infty$ $\\propto$ $\\Omega$\\_(y1,$\\infty$).Psi\\_B} \\\\\n  &\\to 0.\\times 10^{-54},\\text{10d: y2 -> $\\infty$: root of q2 -> $\\theta$-2h} \\\\\n  &\\to 1.500000045000001350000\\times 10^{-8} \\\\\n  &,\\text{10d: y2 -> $\\infty$: F2 -> F1 on \\{$\\theta$-2h, $\\theta$-h\\}, 0 on \\{$\\theta$, $\\theta$+h\\}} \\\\\n  &\\to 2.537312782924911818594650497299231814760097155432\\times 10^{-8} \\\\\n  &,\\text{10d: <x0|M(w)M(y1,$\\infty$)|Psi> $\\propto$ det N(w) det N\\_$\\infty$(y1)} \\\\\n  &\\to 0.\\times 10^{-54}\\rvert\\!\\rangle\n\\end{aligned}",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
     ],
     "id": "e36bd501-9baa-4d2a-a19a-f512f09f1948"
    }
   ],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "**Result 10d. How $\\det Q(y)$ degenerates.**\n\n**The limit is not a single delta function.** As $y_2\\to\\infty$, the root of the vacuum $q_2$ tends to $\\theta-2h$, at rate $O(1/y_2)$. That zero cancels one power of $y_2$, so after rescaling\n$$F_2=Q_2\\ \\longrightarrow\\ \\big(F_2(\\theta-2h),F_2(\\theta-h),F_2(\\theta),F_2(\\theta+h)\\big)\\propto(1,\\,1/y_1,\\,0,\\,0).$$\nThat is $F_1=y_1^{-x/h}$ restricted to $\\{\\theta-2h,\\theta-h\\}$. Equivalently, up to a constant,\n$$F_2^{(\\infty)}(x)=\\frac{y_1^{-x/h}}{\\Gamma\\big((\\theta-x)/h\\big)},$$\nwhich vanishes at $\\theta,\\theta+h$ and is equal to $F_1$ at $\\theta-h,\\theta-2h$.\n\n**The degenerate determinant.** $\\det N_\\infty[Q_B;y_1]=\\det N[P=Q_B;\\ F_1=y_1^{-x/h},\\ F_2=F_2^{(\\infty)}]$ satisfies\n$$\\frac{\\det N_\\infty[Q_B;y_1]}{\\Psi^B_Q(x_0)}\\ \\propto\\ \\prod_i\\big(1-z_i/y_1\\big)^{-\\mu_i(B)},$$\nwhich is the eigenvalue of $\\rho((1-G(z)^T/y_1)^{-1})$, exact to $10^{-54}$.\n\n**The product.**\n$$\\langle x_0|M(w)M(y_1,\\infty)|\\Psi_B\\rangle\\ \\propto\\ \\frac{\\det N[Q_B,Q_{{\\rm vac},w}]\\ \\det N_\\infty[Q_B;y_1]}{\\Psi^B_Q(x_0)^2},$$\nand by 10b this covers every generic rotation of $x_0$.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### 10e. The degenerate $3\\times3$ reduces to an su(2)-like $2\\times2$\nWith $F_1=E\\equiv y_1^{-x/h}$, $E(x+h)=E(x)/y_1$. So in the two $F_1$ rows, the $\\langle PF^{[2]}\\rangle$ column is $-1/y_1$ times the $-\\langle PF\\rangle$ column.\n- **Column operation.** Adding $1/y_1$ times column 1 to column 2 zeroes column 2 in the $F_1$ rows.\n- **The $F_2$ row.** Its new column-2 entry is $-w_1P^3(\\theta-h)E(\\theta-h)/y_1$, which cancels the $Q^3(\\theta-h)$ in $\\Psi_Q(x_0)$.\n- **Result.**\n$$\\prod_i\\Big(1-\\frac{z_i}{y_1}\\Big)^{-\\mu_i}\\ \\propto\\ \\frac{\\det_{j=3,2}\\big[-\\langle Q^jE\\rangle,\\ \\langle Q^{j[-2]}E\\rangle\\big]}{Q^2(\\theta-2h)Q^3(\\theta-3h)-Q^3(\\theta-2h)Q^2(\\theta-3h)}.$$\n  This is a $2\\times2$ determinant in the $(Q^2,Q^3)$ pair with the twist insertion $y_1^{-x/h}$, i.e. su(2)-like.\n- **Rotation overlap at L=1.** It is therefore (the $3\\times3$ for $\\Omega_w$) $\\times$ (this $2\\times2$).",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "br1[f_] := Sum[wgt[n] f[thN - n hN], {n, polesN}];\nsu2det[B_, y_] := Module[{E1 = Function[x, N[y^(-(x - thN)/hN), prec]]},\n   Det[Table[{-br1[Function[x, QU[SZ, B, j, x] E1[x]]], br1[Function[x, QU[SZ, B, j, x - hN] E1[x]]]}, {j, {3, 2}}]]];\nminor2[B_] := QU[SZ, B, 2, thN - 2 hN] QU[SZ, B, 3, thN - 3 hN] - QU[SZ, B, 3, thN - 2 hN] QU[SZ, B, 2, thN - 3 hN];\nchecks[\"10e: resolvent factor = 2x2 (Q3,Q2) det with y^(-x/h) / 2x2 minor\"] = Max[Table[With[{r = Table[(su2det[B, y]/minor2[B])/(Times @@ ((1 - zN/y)^(-SZ[\"mu\"][[B]]))), {B, nS}]}, Max[Abs[r/r[[1]] - 1]]], {y, {-6/5, 3, 5/7 + I/3}}]];\nchecks[\"10e: resolvent factor = 2x2 (Q3,Q2) det with y^(-x/h) / 2x2 minor\"]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
