ght:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˆ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">2)</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-20.41em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">random a: all solutions on (I)</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-19.21em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">fit: w eigen-bra (in image)</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-18.01em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">fit: (I) point (in image)</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-16.81em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">fit: (II) point (in image)</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-15.61em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">fit: generic orbit point (NOT in image; best residual)</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-14.41em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">(I): a </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∝</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"> (1, -(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.05278em;\">β</span><span class=\"mord\">+</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.05556em;\">γ</span><span class=\"mord\">), </span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.05278em;\">β</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.05556em;\">γ</span><span class=\"mord\">)</span></span></span></s